"realistic":{"w":"realistic","firstLevel":"初中","cn":"adj. 现实的； 现实主义的； 逼真的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["现实的","现实主义的","逼真的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/riəˈlistik/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˌriːəˈlɪstɪk/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=realistic&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"He says \"The more accurately reality is presented, the less understandable the story, and the more understandable the story, the less <B>realistic</B> it is.\"","cn":"","src":"2011·四川·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（四川）· 阅读D","year":2011,"region":"四川","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"We must be <B>realistic</B> in our self-estimation, neither being conceited nor belittling ourselves.","cn":"我们的自我评价应该实事求是，不要骄傲自大，也不要妄自菲薄。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"To increase the likelihood of success, one should set <B>realistic</B> goals and work persistently towards them.","cn":"为了增加成功的可能性，人们应该设定现实的目标并坚持不懈地朝着目标努力。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"That means we need modest, <B>realistic</B> expectations, and we need to teach people to cook food that's good enough to share with family and friends.","cn":"这意味着我们需要适度的、符合现实的期望，我们需要教会人们烹饪足够好的食物与家人和朋友分享。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"really","ph":"/ˈriəli/","cn":"adv. 真正地， 实际上； 很， 十分， 全然"},{"w":"real","ph":"/ˈriəl/","cn":"adj. 实际的；真实的；实在的；adv. 真正地；确实"},{"w":"realization","ph":"/.riəlaiˈzeiʃən/","cn":"n. （理想等的）实现"},{"w":"realize","ph":"/ˈriəlaiz/","cn":"v. 认识到； 了解； 实现"},{"w":"reality","ph":"/riˈæliti/","cn":"n. 现实；实际；真实"},{"w":"realized","ph":"/ˈriːəlaɪzd/","cn":"adj. 已实现的，已完成的（realised "}],"syn":[]},"tag":["cet6","ky"],"collins":2,"oxford":1,"frq":3993,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/realistic.webp","syl":{"n":4,"s":2,"l":["re","a","li","stic"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
