"accumulate":{"w":"accumulate","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 累积；积聚","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["累积","积聚"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/əˈkjuːmjuleit/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/əˈkjuːmjəleɪt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=accumulate&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"The consequence, if the bubbles <B>accumulate</B> in a joint, is sharp pain and a bent body — thus the name.","cn":"","src":"2013·江苏·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读C","year":2013,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"There are among some 40 collections that are being shown at \"The Museum Of\" — the first of several new museums which, over the next two years, will exhibit the objects <B>accumulated</B> by unknown collectors.","cn":"","src":"2014·安徽·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（安徽）· 阅读C","year":2014,"region":"安徽","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Lead can <B>accumulate</B> in the body until toxic levels are reached.","cn":"铅可以在体内积聚直至到达有毒的程度。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"It was his ambition to <B>accumulate</B> a million dollars before he turned thirty.","cn":"他的雄心是在30岁以前积攒100万美元。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"accumulated","ph":"/əˈkjuːmjəleɪtɪd/","cn":"adj. 累计的；累积的；v. 积累；积聚，堆积"},{"w":"accumulative","ph":"/əˈkjuːmjələtɪv/","cn":"adj. 累积的，逐渐增加的"},{"w":"accumulation","ph":"/əˌkjuːmjəˈleɪʃn/","cn":"n. 积累，堆积；堆积物，堆积量"},{"w":"accumulator","ph":"/əˈkjuːmjəleɪtər/","cn":"n. 蓄电池，充电电池；（计算机）累加器；积聚者"}],"syn":["collect","compile"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":5083,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/3e6cc9ad8e3c3a37c95b60d2735172e5.jpg?","syl":{"n":4,"s":1,"l":["ac","cum","u","late"]},"flags":[]},
"accuracy":{"w":"accuracy","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. [数] 精确度，准确性","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["[数] 精确度","准确性"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈækjurəsi/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈækjərəsi; ˈækjʊrəsi/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=accuracy&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"The study also found that the average <B>accuracy</B> could increase even if the estimates were not fully independent.","cn":"","src":"2023·新课标Ⅰ卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（新课标Ⅰ卷）· 阅读D","year":2023,"region":"新课标Ⅰ卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"Unskillful tasks are left to machines and products are better made and produced with greater <B>accuracy</B> than any human hand could ever have done.","cn":"","src":"2014·江西·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（江西）· 阅读D","year":2014,"region":"江西","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"The issue here is not the <B>accuracy</B> of Tolstoy's description--it seems not that far off from historical accounts but his choice of facts：other things that could be said of the man are not said.","cn":"","src":"2008·广东·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（广东）· 阅读C","year":2008,"region":"广东","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"A high degree of <B>accuracy</B> is needed.","cn":"需要高度的准确性。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"accurate","ph":"/ˈækjurət/","cn":"adj. 正确的， 准确的"},{"w":"accurately","ph":"/ˈækjərətli/","cn":"adv. 精确地，准确地"}],"syn":["truth"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":0,"oxford":0,"frq":4076,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/accuracy.webp","syl":{"n":4,"s":0,"l":["ac","cur","a","cy"]},"flags":[]},
