"acknowledge":{"w":"acknowledge","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 承认；答谢；报偿；告知已收到","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["承认","答谢","报偿","告知已收到"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/əkˈnɒlidʒ/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/əkˈnɑːlɪdʒ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=acknowledge&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"He <B>acknowledges</B> that wildernesses do provide useful services, such as water conservation.","cn":"","src":"2012·北京·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2012年高考英语（北京）· 阅读D","year":2012,"region":"北京","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"But in truth, the harder they look at their lives, the more they <B>acknowledge</B> their big differences in circumstance and basic nature.","cn":"","src":"2013·湖北·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（湖北）· 阅读B","year":2013,"region":"湖北","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"And though one of the executives <B>acknowledged</B> that Brutus had the good of the republic in mind, Caesar was nevertheless his superior.","cn":"","src":"2015·上海（秋考）·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2015年高考英语（上海（秋考））· 阅读C","year":2015,"region":"上海（秋考）","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"I allowed myself to <B>acknowledge</B> my true feelings.","cn":"我愿意承认自己的真实感情。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"acknowledged","ph":"/əkˈnɑːlɪdʒd/","cn":"adj. 公认的，被普遍认可的；v. （ackn"},{"w":"acknowledgement","ph":"/əkˈnɑːlɪdʒmənt/","cn":"n. 承认；感谢；（作者的）致谢；回执；（表示注"},{"w":"acknowledgment","ph":"/əkˈnɑːlɪdʒmənt/","cn":"n. 承认，认可；感谢，致谢（书中致谢部分常用复"}],"syn":["admit"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":1654,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/f076f873ad42c6722abdb5b866e2e6c8.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":1,"l":["ac","know","ledge"]},"flags":[]},
"acquaintance":{"w":"acquaintance","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 熟人；相识；了解；知道","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["熟人","相识","了解","知道"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/əˈkweintəns/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/əˈkweɪntəns/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=acquaintance&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"I am delighted to make your <B>acquaintance</B>, Mrs Baker.","cn":"贝克太太，我很高兴与您相识。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"I made the <B>acquaintance</B> of several musicians around that time.","cn":"大约在那段时间，我结识了几位音乐家。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"He exchanged a few words with the proprietor, an old <B>acquaintance</B> of his.","cn":"他跟一位业主，他的一位老相识交谈了几句。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Strew a few of these rose petals around your next conversation with the Lifestyle Demon of your <B>acquaintance</B>.","cn":"","src":"FORBES","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · FORBES"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"acquaint","ph":"/əˈkweint/","cn":"vt. 使认识， 使了解"},{"w":"acquainted","ph":"/əˈkweɪntɪd/","cn":"adj. 相识的，认识的；<正式>熟悉的，了解的"},{"w":"acquaintanceship","ph":"/əˈkweɪntənsʃɪp/","cn":"n. 认识，相识；交往关系"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","gre"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":6274,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/dd340916b32ec190d4b5a359c729a3dc.png?","syl":{"n":3,"s":1,"l":["ac","quain","tance"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
