"aggression":{"w":"aggression","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 侵略；进攻；侵犯；侵害","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["侵略","进攻","侵犯","侵害"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/əˈgreʃən/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/əˈɡreʃ(ə)n/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=aggression&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"In the animal kingdom, weakness can bring about <B>aggression</B> in other animals.","cn":"","src":"2011·广东·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（广东）· 阅读A","year":2011,"region":"广东","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"There was a reported coldness between the cat and dog in 25% of the homes, while <B>aggression</B> and fighting were observed in 10% of the homes.","cn":"","src":"2011·广东·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（广东）· 阅读B","year":2011,"region":"广东","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"Sport became the perfect outlet for his <B>aggression</B>.","cn":"运动成为他攻击性心理的最佳出路。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Last month he signed a new non-<B>aggression</B> pact with Germany.","cn":"上个月他与德国签署了一份新的互不侵犯条约。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"aggressive","ph":"/əˈgresiv/","cn":"adj. 侵犯的， 侵略的， 挑衅的； 敢作敢为的， 有"},{"w":"aggress","ph":"/əˈɡres/","cn":"vi. <正式>发起攻击；侵略；侵犯（常与 ag"},{"w":"aggressively","ph":"/əˈɡresɪvli/","cn":"adv. 好斗地，攻击地，侵略地（多含贬义）；积"},{"w":"aggressiveness","ph":"/əˈɡresɪvnəs/","cn":"n. 攻击性，侵略性，好斗性；进取精神，闯劲，霸"},{"w":"aggressor","ph":"/əˈɡresər/","cn":"n. 侵略者，侵略国，挑衅者"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet6","toefl","gre"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":4521,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/58d01b19972281e67cb4da5c57c583b8.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":1,"l":["ag","gres","sion"]},"flags":[]},
