"algebra":{"w":"algebra","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 代数学","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["代数学"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈældʒibrə/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈældʒɪbrə/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=algebra&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"These 30 fantastic lectures are designed to provide students with an understanding of arithmetic and to prepare them for <B>Algebra</B> and beyond.","cn":"","src":"2012·北京·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2012年高考英语（北京）· 阅读A","year":2012,"region":"北京","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"At twenty he translated Euler's standard work on <B>algebra</B> into English.","cn":"20岁时，他把尤勒的权威代数著作译成了英语。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"I barely passed <B>algebra</B> and geometry, but here she's head of her class in both.","cn":"我勉强通过了代数和几何，但她这两门课在班里都是第一。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"You know from <B>algebra</B> I can't actually solve this. There may be multiple solutions to this.","cn":"你知道从代数的角度我解不出来。这可能会有多种解决办法。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"algebraic","ph":"/ˌældʒɪˈbreɪɪk/","cn":"adj. （数）代数的，关于代数学的"},{"w":"algebraical","ph":"","cn":"adj. 代数学的（等于 algebraic）"},{"w":"algebraically","ph":"/ˌældʒəˈbreɪɪkli/","cn":"adv. 用代数方法"},{"w":"algebraist","ph":"/ældʒɪˈbreɪɪst/","cn":"n. 代数学家"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","toefl"],"collins":0,"oxford":0,"frq":12790,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/65b4d72c44c327e338ec381b8a75ad23.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["al","ge","bra"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
"alike":{"w":"alike","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 相似的；相同的；adv. 以同样的方式；类似于","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["相似的","相同的"]},{"pos":"adv","cn":["以同样的方式","类似于"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/əˈlaik/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/əˈlaɪk/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=alike&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Parents and kids today dress <B>alike</B>, listen to the same music, and are friends.","cn":"","src":"2008·广东·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（广东）· 阅读A","year":2008,"region":"广东","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"Why do young children and scientists seem to be so much <B>alike</B>?","cn":"","src":"2016·浙江·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2016年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读C","year":2016,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Mothers, doctors and nurse <B>alike</B> have no idea of where a baby's blood sugar level lies.","cn":"","src":"2012·广东·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2012年高考英语（广东）· 阅读B","year":2012,"region":"广东","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"They tried to treat all their children <B>alike</B>.","cn":"他们尽量对自己的孩子一视同仁。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":["similar","like"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":4389,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/c2c7e0e05e6d0043aa9274bb5fa04432.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["a","like"]},"flags":[]},
