"alley":{"w":"alley","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 小巷；小路；小径","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["小巷","小路","小径"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈæli/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈæli/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=alley&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"I dodged back into the <B>alley</B> and waited a minute.","cn":"我往后一闪，躲进胡同里等了一会儿。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"When he saw the police arrive, he bolted down an <B>alley</B>.","cn":"他看见警察来了，便从小巷逃走了。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"He wheeled his bike into the <B>alley</B> at the side of the house.","cn":"他把自行车推进了房屋一侧的胡同里。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Another <B>alley</B> sells honey from Yemen and dates from Qatar, Saudi Arabia and Oman .","cn":"","src":"BBC","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · BBC"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"alleyway","ph":"/ˈæliˌweɪ/","cn":"n. （常指建筑物之间或后面的）窄街，胡同，小巷"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","ielts"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":4340,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/c31458279f7549721b880bb8e5b87760.png?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["al","ley"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","fam_gap"]},
"allocate":{"w":"allocate","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 分配；拨出；使坐落于","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["分配","拨出","使坐落于"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈæləukeit/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈæləkeɪt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=allocate&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Of course, markets and queues are not the only ways of <B>allocating</B> things.","cn":"","src":"2013·江苏·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读B","year":2013,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"Markets and queues — paying and waiting — are two different ways of <B>allocating</B> things, and each is appropriate to different activities.","cn":"","src":"2013·江苏·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读B","year":2013,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"We then <B>allocate</B> the memory.","cn":"然后我们分配内存。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"The effect is caused by the way we <B>allocate</B> our attention.","cn":"这种效应是由我们分配注意力的方式引起的。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"allocable","ph":"/ˈæləʊkəbl/","cn":"adj. 可拨出的；可分配的"},{"w":"allocation","ph":"/ˌæləˈkeɪʃ(ə)n/","cn":"n. 配给量，划拨款，份额；分配，分派"},{"w":"allocator","ph":"/ˈæləkeɪtər/","cn":"n. n. 分配者，配给者；（计算机）分配器，分"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":6763,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/allocate.webp","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["al","lo","cate"]},"flags":[]},
