"alongside":{"w":"alongside","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adv. 在旁边；prep. 在……旁边","senses":[{"pos":"adv","cn":["在旁边"]},{"pos":"prep","cn":["在……旁边"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/əˈlɒŋˈsaid/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/əˌlɔːŋˈsaɪd/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=alongside&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"In my view, new architectural styles can exist perfectly well <B>alongside</B> an older style.","cn":"","src":"2014·安徽·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（安徽）· 阅读D","year":2014,"region":"安徽","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"People behind me began to get impatient and angry, with some speeding up <B>alongside</B> me, horning or even shouting at me.","cn":"","src":"2011·广东·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（广东）· 阅读A","year":2011,"region":"广东","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"The western half of the U.S. was full of grizzlies when Europeans came, with a rough number of 50,000 or more living <B>alongside</B> Native Americans.","cn":"","src":"2023·全国甲卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（全国甲卷）· 阅读D","year":2023,"region":"全国甲卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"You'll see large sea turtles swimming <B>alongside</B> schools of tropical fish.","cn":"你会看见巨大的海龟身边游着成群的热带鱼。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":["aboard"]},"tag":["gk","cet6","ky","ielts"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":4203,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/alongside.webp","syl":{"n":3,"s":2,"l":["a","long","side"]},"flags":[]},
