"appreciate":{"w":"appreciate","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 欣赏；感激；领会；鉴别","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["欣赏","感激","领会","鉴别"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/əˈpriːʃieit/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/əˈpriːʃieɪt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=appreciate&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"While we <B>appreciate</B> such words of wisdom, we rarely try to follow them in our lives.","cn":"","src":"2022·天津（第二次）·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2022年高考英语（天津（第二次））· 阅读D","year":2022,"region":"天津（第二次）","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"Had my neighbor told me of the upcoming rainstorm with sympathy, I would have <B>appreciated</B> his warning.","cn":"","src":"2009·浙江·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2009年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读D","year":2009,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"I felt that this was a gift that my father would truly <B>appreciate</B>.","cn":"","src":"2012·湖南·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2012年高考英语（湖南）· 阅读A","year":2012,"region":"湖南","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"Peter stood by me when I most needed it. I'll always <B>appreciate</B> that.","cn":"彼得在我最需要时支持了我。我对此将永远感激。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"appreciation","ph":"/ə.priːʃiˈeiʃən/","cn":"n. 欣赏，鉴别；增值；感谢"},{"w":"appreciative","ph":"/əˈpriːʃiətiv/","cn":"adj. 表示赞赏的，感谢的"},{"w":"appreciatively","ph":"/əˈpriːʃətɪvli/","cn":"adv. 欣赏地，赞赏地；感激地"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":1738,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/bbab766fd3eca3d38ab91f5e7606c6aa.jpg?","syl":{"n":4,"s":1,"l":["ap","pre","ci","ate"]},"flags":[]},
