"badly":{"w":"badly","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adv. 非常，很；严重地，厉害地；恶劣地","senses":[{"pos":"adv","cn":["非常","很","严重地","厉害地","恶劣地"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈbædli/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈbædli/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=badly&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"What's more, they had not wanted enough to be rich and successful; otherwise they could not possibly have managed their lives so <B>badly</B>.","cn":"","src":"2011·陕西·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（陕西）· 阅读C","year":2011,"region":"陕西","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Though <B>badly</B> hurt and shaken, the old lady looked up at Tenyson with love in her eyes and gave him a little smile.","cn":"","src":"2014·福建·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（福建）· 阅读A","year":2014,"region":"福建","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"But sometimes doctors write too <B>badly</B> and even the chemist can not read them.","cn":"","src":"八年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"Our plans had gone <B>badly</B> adrift.","cn":"我们的计划已严重受挫。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"bad","ph":"/bæd/","cn":"adj. 坏的； 不利的； 差的， 有缺陷的； 邪恶的，"},{"w":"badness","ph":"/ˈbædnəs/","cn":"n. 坏，恶；不良；恶劣状态"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","ky"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":3111,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/badly.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["ba","dly"]},"flags":[]},
