"blame":{"w":"blame","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 责备；归咎于；n. 责备；责任；过失","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["责备","归咎于"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["责备","责任","过失"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/bleim/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/bleɪm/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=blame&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Instead, we tend to do the opposite—find someone else to pass the <B>blame</B> on to.","cn":"","src":"2010·天津·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2010年高考英语（天津）· 阅读D","year":2010,"region":"天津","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"Or you may <B>blame</B> yourself for all your problems, thus internalizing your victimization.","cn":"","src":"2012·天津·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2012年高考英语（天津）· 阅读D","year":2012,"region":"天津","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"Ceely's near miss made the news because she <B>blamed</B> it on her GPS.","cn":"","src":"2011·浙江·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读A","year":2011,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"Let the people suffer. I will take <B>blame</B>.","cn":"苦一苦百姓，骂名我来担！","src":"大明王朝","srcType":"media","srcFull":"《大明王朝》赵贞吉（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"blamed","ph":"/bleɪmd/","cn":"v. blame 的过去式和过去分词：责备，谴责"},{"w":"blameless","ph":"/ˈbleɪmləs/","cn":"adj. 清白的，无可责备的，无过失的"},{"w":"blamable","ph":"/ˈbleɪməbəl/","cn":"adj. 可责备的；有过失的"},{"w":"blameable","ph":"/ˈbleɪməbl/","cn":"adj. 有过失的；该责备的"},{"w":"blameful","ph":"/ˈbleɪmfəl/","cn":"adj. 应受责备的；该受谴责的"},{"w":"blameworthy","ph":"/ˈbleɪmwɜːrði/","cn":"adj. 应受谴责的，该受责备的"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts"],"collins":4,"oxford":1,"frq":1797,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/953190db5aa859f947030bfb00db1b83.jpg?","syl":{"n":1,"s":0,"l":["blame"]},"flags":[]},
"blanket":{"w":"blanket","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 毛毯，毯子；毯状物，覆盖层；adj. 总括的，全体的；没有限制的；v. 覆盖，掩盖；用毯覆盖","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["毛毯","毯子","毯状物","覆盖层"]},{"pos":"adj","cn":["总括的","全体的","没有限制的"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["覆盖","掩盖","用毯覆盖"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈblæŋkit/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈblæŋkɪt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=blanket&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Then he piled branches on top of himself, like a <B>blanket</B>, to stay as warm as he could.","cn":"","src":"2015·北京·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2015年高考英语（北京）· 阅读A","year":2015,"region":"北京","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"They moved in with a local family, the Harrisons, and, like them, had little privacy, rare baths, and a <B>blanket</B> of snow on their quilt when they woke up in the morning.","cn":"","src":"2022·全国乙卷·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2022年高考英语（全国乙卷）· 阅读B","year":2022,"region":"全国乙卷","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"The accommodation wasn't wonderful,but we had everything we needed (beds,<B>blankets</B>,food),and we were pleased to be out of the city and in the fresh air.","cn":"","src":"九年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"I wrapped a <B>blanket</B> around the baby.","cn":"我用毯子把婴儿裹了起来。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"blankety","ph":"/ˈblæŋkɪti/","cn":"adj. 可憎的；可恶的；毫无道理的；adv. "}],"syn":["cover"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","ky","toefl","ielts"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":3306,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/567655014dddd1279bdc09c641653e90.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["blan","ket"]},"flags":[]},
