"botany":{"w":"botany","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 植物学；地区植物总称","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["植物学","地区植物总称"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈbɒtəni/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈbɑːtəni/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=botany&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"The clearest example of this between literate and non-literate worlds is perhaps the meeting of Captain Cook and the Australian Aboriginals at <B>Botany</B> Bay in 1770.","cn":"","src":"2023·全国乙卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（全国乙卷）· 阅读D","year":2023,"region":"全国乙卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"They shared a common interest in <B>botany</B>.","cn":"他们都对植物学感兴趣。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"To what degree are you interested in <B>botany</B>?","cn":"你对植物学的兴趣达到什么程度？","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"As growing up, I have seen the <B>botany</B> garden, the museum, the gallery, and other stuff.","cn":"在成长过程中，我参观过植物园、博物馆、美术馆以及其他各类场馆。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"botanical","ph":"/bəˈtænikəl/","cn":"adj. 植物学的；n. 植物性药材"},{"w":"botanic","ph":"/bəˈtænɪk/","cn":"adj. 植物的；植物学的"},{"w":"botanist","ph":"/ˈbɑːtənɪst/","cn":"n. 植物学家"},{"w":"botanize","ph":"/ˈbɑːt(ə)nˌaɪz/","cn":"vt. 为植物学目的而探索……；vi. （为植物"}],"syn":["vegetation"]},"tag":["gk","toefl","gre"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":20491,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/7e51d0af45a4d1eb878bfff994baca4f.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["bo","ta","ny"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
