"brick":{"w":"brick","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 砖，砖块；砖形物；心肠好的人；v. 用砖砌；adj. 用砖做的；似砖的","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["砖","砖块","砖形物","心肠好的人"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["用砖砌"]},{"pos":"adj","cn":["用砖做的","似砖的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/brik/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/brɪk/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=brick&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"The world economy has run into a <B>brick</B> wall.","cn":"","src":"2008·上海（秋考）·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（上海（秋考））· 阅读D","year":2008,"region":"上海（秋考）","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"He asked the workers to use traditional techniques to make the <B>bricks</B> into walls, roofs and corridors.","cn":"","src":"2018·新课标Ⅲ卷·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2018年高考英语（新课标Ⅲ卷）· 阅读C","year":2018,"region":"新课标Ⅲ卷","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"However, he didn't make the <B>bricks</B> for his house, cut his trees into boards, make the plows, or any of the other hundreds of things a farm needs.","cn":"","src":"2013·浙江·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读A","year":2013,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"The school is built of <B>brick</B>.","cn":"那所学校是用砖建造的。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","ky","toefl"],"collins":2,"oxford":1,"frq":3315,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/9fd2a77d881275b78540b69ed60c0c24.png?","syl":{"n":1,"s":0,"l":["brick"]},"flags":["fam_gap"]},
