"competence":{"w":"competence","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 能力，胜任；权限；作证能力；足以过舒适生活的收入","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["能力","胜任","权限","作证能力","足以过舒适生活的收入"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈkɒmpitəns/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈkɑːmpɪtəns/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=competence&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Many people have testified to his <B>competence</B>.","cn":"很多人已证实了他的能力。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"The judge has to act within the <B>competence</B> of the court.","cn":"法官必须在法庭的权限范围内行使权力。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"He stood out in terms of <B>competence</B> from all his fellows.","cn":"他在能力方面比他所有同事都突出。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"\"The voters see it as leadership <B>competence</B>, and then that can translate into many different things, \" Dowd said.","cn":"","src":"NPR","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · NPR"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"competent","ph":"/ˈkɒmpitənt/","cn":"adj. 胜任的，有能力的"},{"w":"competently","ph":"/ˈkɑːmpɪtəntli/","cn":"adv. 胜任地，称职地；适合地，适当地"},{"w":"competency","ph":"/ˈkɑːmpɪtənsi/","cn":"n. 能力，本领；权限，管辖权；语言能力（=la"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet6","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":5191,"img":"","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["com","pe","tence"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","no_img"]},
