"compulsory":{"w":"compulsory","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 义务的；必修的；被强制的；n. （花样滑冰、竞技体操等的）规定动作","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["义务的","必修的","被强制的"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["（花样滑冰","竞技体操等的）规定动作"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/kəmˈpʌlsəri/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/kəmˈpʌlsəri/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=compulsory&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"To increase levels of community service，some schools have launched <B>compulsory</B> volunteer programs.","cn":"","src":"2015·江苏·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2015年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读C","year":2015,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"There is a <B>compulsory</B> course in statistics.","cn":"有一门统计学的必修课。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"English is a <B>compulsory</B> subject at this level.","cn":"英语在这一级别是必修科目。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Certain courses are <B>compulsory</B>, others are optional.","cn":"某些课程是必修的，其他是选修的。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"compulsive","ph":"/kəmˈpʌlsɪv/","cn":"adj. 难以抑制的，不能自拔的；引人入胜的"},{"w":"compulsively","ph":"/kəmˈpʌlsɪvli/","cn":"adv. 强迫地，不由自主地"},{"w":"compulsorily","ph":"/kəmˈpʌlsərəli/","cn":"adv. 强制地，强迫地，必须地"},{"w":"compulsion","ph":"/kəmˈpʌlʃ(ə)n/","cn":"n. 强烈的欲望，冲动；被迫的状态；强迫力，强制"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":12735,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/compulsory.webp","syl":{"n":4,"s":1,"l":["com","pul","sor","y"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
"comrade":{"w":"comrade","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 同志；伙伴","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["同志","伙伴"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈkɒmreid/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈkɑːmræd/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=comrade&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Better be careful of your bookish approach, <B>comrade</B>.","cn":"同志，注意你的书生气！","src":"新英汉","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《新英汉大辞典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Most of the goats ran away from their rough <B>comrade</B>.","cn":"大多数山羊都从它们粗暴的伙伴身边跑开了。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"We can't remain indifferent when any <B>comrade</B> is in difficulty.","cn":"同志们有困难我们不能不闻不问。","src":"新英汉","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《新英汉大辞典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"He died in an explosion in Helmand province helping a wounded <B>comrade</B>, who survived.","cn":"","src":"BBC","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · BBC"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"comradely","ph":"/ˈkɑːmrædli/","cn":"adj. 同志式的；同志般的"},{"w":"comradeship","ph":"/ˈkɑːmrædʃɪp/","cn":"n. 友谊，同志关系，同志情谊"},{"w":"comradeliness","ph":"/ˈkɑːmrədlɪnəs/","cn":"n. 同志情谊；友情"},{"w":"comradery","ph":"/ˈkɑːmrædri/","cn":"n. （不可数）同志情谊，伙伴情谊（等于 cam"}],"syn":["companion","fellow","familiar","associate"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":7425,"img":"","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["com","rade"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","no_img"]},
