"concern":{"w":"concern","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 涉及，关系到；使担心；n. 关系；关心；关心的事；忧虑","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["涉及","关系到","使担心"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["关系","关心","关心的事","忧虑"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/kənˈsəːn/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/kənˈsɝn/","usSrc":"Wiktionary"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=concern&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"And as far as your body is <B>concerned</B>, it's \"use it, or lose it\"!","cn":"","src":"2013·浙江·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读B","year":2013,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"Food waste is a growing <B>concern</B> in the restaurant, supermarket, and supply chain industries.","cn":"","src":"2025·全国Ⅱ卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2025年高考英语（全国Ⅱ卷）· 阅读D","year":2025,"region":"全国Ⅱ卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"College administrators are <B>concerned</B> that they will not have enough aid money to go around.","cn":"","src":"2011·山东·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（山东）· 阅读C","year":2011,"region":"山东","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Our primary <B>concern</B> must be the children.","cn":"我们首先要关心的必须是儿童。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"concerned","ph":"/kənˈsɜːrnd/","cn":"adj. 相关的， 关于（某个主题）的；担心的，"},{"w":"concernedly","ph":"/kənˈsɜːrndli/","cn":"adv. 担心地；关心公众事务地"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","ielts"],"collins":5,"oxford":1,"frq":717,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/7edee0d94cbdbc21620ae57eb4ad943c.png?","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["con","cern"]},"flags":[]},
"conclude":{"w":"conclude","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 推断；决定，作结论；结束","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["推断","决定","作结论","结束"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/kənˈkluːd/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/kənˈkluːd/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=conclude&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Researchers <B>concluded</B> that the French tend to stop eating when they feel full.","cn":"","src":"2014·陕西·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（陕西）· 阅读C","year":2014,"region":"陕西","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"After years of study, researchers have <B>concluded</B> that it's what's inside that matters, not just the size of the brain.","cn":"","src":"2008·陕西·阅读E","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（陕西）· 阅读E","year":2008,"region":"陕西","section":"阅读E"},{"en":"Bill Bryson, for example, <B>concludes</B> that, as the English weather is not at all exciting, the obsession with it can hardly be understood.","cn":"","src":"2013·重庆·阅读E","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（重庆）· 阅读E","year":2013,"region":"重庆","section":"阅读E"},{"en":"In order to <B>conclude</B> the business, I hope you'll meet me halfway.","cn":"为了做成这批生意，我希望双方都各让步一半。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"conclusion","ph":"/kənˈkluːʒən/","cn":"n. 结论；结局；推论"},{"w":"conclusive","ph":"/kənˈkluːsiv/","cn":"adj. 得出结论的"},{"w":"concluded","ph":"/kənˈkluːdɪd/","cn":"v. conclude 的过去式和过去分词：结束"},{"w":"concluding","ph":"/kənˈkluːdɪŋ/","cn":"v. （使）结束，终止；<正式>缔结，达成（协定"},{"w":"conclusively","ph":"/kənˈkluːsɪvli/","cn":"adv. 最后地，决定性地，确凿地"},{"w":"conclusiveness","ph":"","cn":"n. 结论性；决定性"}],"syn":["reason"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":1670,"img":"","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["con","clude"]},"flags":["no_img"]},
