"concrete":{"w":"concrete","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 混凝土的；实在的，具体的；有形的；v. 凝结；n. 具体物；凝结物","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["混凝土的","实在的","具体的","有形的"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["凝结"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["具体物","凝结物"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈkɒnkriːt/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈkɑːnkriːt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=concrete&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"To them security is a steel river thundering on a <B>concrete</B> road.","cn":"","src":"2014·天津·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（天津）· 阅读D","year":2014,"region":"天津","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"\"People today are often tethered to their devices, thinking in very <B>concrete</B> terms,\" added Schnall.","cn":"","src":"2026·全国Ⅰ卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2026年高考英语（全国Ⅰ卷）· 阅读D","year":2026,"region":"全国Ⅰ卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"From the basic <B>concrete</B> ideas to the more abstract problems, he is master in making math lectures learner-friendlier and less scary.","cn":"","src":"2012·北京·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2012年高考英语（北京）· 阅读A","year":2012,"region":"北京","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"This strange characteristic of <B>concrete</B> made a significant contribution to the success of the Roman Empire.","cn":"混凝土的这种奇特特性为罗马帝国的成功作出了重大贡献。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"concretely","ph":"/kɑːnˈkriːtli/","cn":"adv. 具体地"},{"w":"concreteness","ph":"/ˈkɑːnkritnəs/","cn":"n. 具体性，具体"},{"w":"concretion","ph":"/kənˈkriːʃən/","cn":"n. 凝结、凝固、聚结；凝结物、凝固物、凝块；（"},{"w":"concretise","ph":"/ˈkɒnkriːtaɪz/","cn":"vt. （英）使……具体化（等于 concret"},{"w":"concretize","ph":"/ˈkɑːnkriˌtaɪz/","cn":"vt. 使有形化；使具体化"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":3310,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/1ce17f6a7607db2d18497369db0899fa.png?","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["con","crete"]},"flags":[]},
"condemn":{"w":"condemn","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 谴责；判刑，定罪；声讨","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["谴责","判刑","定罪","声讨"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/kənˈdem/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/kənˈdem/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=condemn&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Typically, cruelty and cheating are universally <B>condemned</B>, while honesty and fairness are praised.","cn":"","src":"2024·北京·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2024年高考英语（北京）· 阅读D","year":2024,"region":"北京","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"However, by showing that television promotes none of the dangerous effects as conventionally believed, Anderson suggests that television cannot be <B>condemned</B> without considering other influences.","cn":"","src":"2015·广东·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2015年高考英语（广东）· 阅读C","year":2015,"region":"广东","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"The Church has a duty to <B>condemn</B> violence.","cn":"基督教会有义务谴责暴力。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Like everyone else, I deplore and <B>condemn</B> this killing.","cn":"我同所有人一样强烈谴责这桩凶杀案。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"condemnatory","ph":"/ˌkɒndəmˈneɪt(ə)rɪ/","cn":"adj. 处罚的；非难的；定罪的"},{"w":"condemnable","ph":"/kənˈdemnəbl/","cn":"adj. 该受责备的，应受谴责的；该罚的；应定罪"},{"w":"condemnation","ph":"/ˌkɑːndemˈneɪʃn/","cn":"n. 谴责，严厉指责；非难的理由"},{"w":"condemning","ph":"/kənˈdemɪŋ/","cn":"v. 谴责，指责（condemn 的现在分词）；"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":3,"oxford":0,"frq":4138,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/condemn.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["con","demn"]},"flags":[]},
