"delay":{"w":"delay","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 延期；耽搁；n. 延期；耽搁；被耽搁或推迟的时间","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["延期","耽搁"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["延期","耽搁","被耽搁或推迟的时间"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/diˈlei/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/dɪˈleɪ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=delay&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"People's hesitancy to <B>delay</B> satisfaction is the most obvious one.","cn":"","src":"2023·北京·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（北京）· 阅读C","year":2023,"region":"北京","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Typically, the preferred sleep/wake cycle is <B>delayed</B> in adolescents, which leads to many students not feeling sleepy until much later in the evenings.","cn":"","src":"2014·四川·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（四川）· 阅读D","year":2014,"region":"四川","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"We tend to choose immediate rewards over larger, <B>delayed</B> ones, even when the delayed rewards are clearly better for us.","cn":"","src":"2023·北京·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（北京）· 阅读C","year":2023,"region":"北京","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"We would like to apologize for the <B>delay</B>.","cn":"我们愿对延迟表示歉意。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"delayed","ph":"/dɪˈleɪd/","cn":"adj. 延误的，延迟的；v. （使）延误，（使"},{"w":"delayer","ph":"/dɪˈleɪər/","cn":"n. 拖延者，延误者；（电子、通信与自动控制技术"}],"syn":["hold","wait"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts"],"collins":4,"oxford":1,"frq":3105,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/051d327047b1f4f9bcda87227a65b77f.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["de","lay"]},"flags":[]},
"delete":{"w":"delete","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 删除","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["删除"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/diˈliːt/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/dɪˈliːt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=delete&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"I selected a file and pressed the <B>delete</B> key.","cn":"我选定了一份文件，然后按下了删除键。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"You should <B>delete</B> the superfluous expressions.","cn":"你应该删掉多余的表达。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Perhaps the time has come to <B>delete</B> it from sports terms.","cn":"也许是时候把它从体育术语中删除了。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"So if it doesn't turn out to your liking, you can just <B>delete</B> it and take another one.","cn":"","src":"CNN","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · CNN"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"deletion","ph":"/dɪˈliːʃn/","cn":"n. 删除，删去的部分；（核酸分子或染色体的）缺"}],"syn":["cancel"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","ky","toefl","ielts"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":8051,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/1cc76934e91d1d5676fac595dbdb4ab2.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["de","lete"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
"deliberately":{"w":"deliberately","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adv. 故意地；谨慎地；慎重地","senses":[{"pos":"adv","cn":["故意地","谨慎地","慎重地"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/diˈlibərətli/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/dɪˈlɪbərətli/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=deliberately&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Only humans and chimps, she said, had a system of communication where they <B>deliberately</B> sent a message to another group member.","cn":"","src":"2021·浙江1月·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2021年高考英语（浙江1月）· 阅读C","year":2021,"region":"浙江1月","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"In addition to the problem of miscomprehension from both sides, there are victories accidentally or <B>deliberately</B> twisted, especially when only the victors know how to write.","cn":"","src":"2023·全国乙卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（全国乙卷）· 阅读D","year":2023,"region":"全国乙卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"He spoke slowly and <B>deliberately</B>.","cn":"他说得缓慢而慎重。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Are you being <B>deliberately</B> obtuse?","cn":"你是不是故意装傻？","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"deliberate","ph":"/diˈlibərət/","cn":"adj. 故意的"},{"w":"deliberative","ph":"/dɪˈlɪbəˌreɪtɪv/","cn":"adj. 审议的，协商的；慎重的，审慎的，深思熟"},{"w":"deliberateness","ph":"/dɪˈlɪbəreɪtnəs/","cn":"n. 审慎；故意；深思熟虑"},{"w":"deliberation","ph":"/dɪˌlɪbəˈreɪʃ(ə)n/","cn":"n. 考虑，思考；从容，审慎；审议，商议；考虑，"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","toefl"],"collins":0,"oxford":1,"frq":4592,"img":"","syl":{"n":5,"s":1,"l":["de","li","ber","a","tely"]},"flags":["no_img"]},
