"dignity":{"w":"dignity","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 尊严；高贵","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["尊严","高贵"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈdigniti/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈdɪɡnəti/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=dignity&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"And by looking at us, listening to us, respecting our input, affirming our value, giving us a sense of <B>dignity</B>, Papa was unquestionably our most influential teacher.","cn":"","src":"2015·福建·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2015年高考英语（福建）· 阅读B","year":2015,"region":"福建","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"He sat with such regal <B>dignity</B>.","cn":"他以王者之尊严就座。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"He conducted himself with grace and <B>dignity</B> throughout the trial.","cn":"在整个审讯过程中他表现得文雅而有尊严。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"He is a practical humanist, who believes in the <B>dignity</B> of mankind.","cn":"他是个真正的人道主义者，信奉人类的尊严。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"dignify","ph":"/ˈdɪɡnɪfaɪ/","cn":"v. 使有尊严，使高贵；使显得堂皇，抬高……的身"},{"w":"dignified","ph":"/ˈdɪɡnɪfaɪd/","cn":"adj. 庄严的，有尊严的，高贵的；v. 使高贵"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":4100,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/7afc81a28317a32e80f6ba2535c9eea0.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["dig","ni","ty"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
