"evidence":{"w":"evidence","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 证据，证明；迹象；明显；v. 证明","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["证据","证明","迹象","明显"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["证明"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈevidəns/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈɛv.ɪ.dəns/","usSrc":"Wiktionary"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=evidence&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"The good news is that there is <B>evidence</B> we can learn to change our own story.","cn":"","src":"2025·北京·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2025年高考英语（北京）· 阅读D","year":2025,"region":"北京","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"<B>Evidence</B> suggests that wheels for transport didn't become popular for a while, though.","cn":"","src":"2013·重庆·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（重庆）· 阅读C","year":2013,"region":"重庆","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Yet there is <B>evidence</B> suggesting that the trend is growing.","cn":"","src":"2016·新课标Ⅰ卷·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2016年高考英语（新课标Ⅰ卷）· 阅读B","year":2016,"region":"新课标Ⅰ卷","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"This new <B>evidence</B> will prove their innocence.","cn":"这一新的证据将证明他们的清白。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"evident","ph":"/ˈevidənt/","cn":"adj. 明显的；明白的"},{"w":"evidently","ph":"/ˈevidəntli/","cn":"adv. 明显地， 显然"},{"w":"evidentiary","ph":"/ˌevəˈdenʃəri/","cn":"adj. 证据的，与证据有关的；用作证据的或基于"},{"w":"evidential","ph":"/ˌevɪˈdenʃl/","cn":"adj. 证据的；基于证据的；提供证据的，可作证"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts"],"collins":4,"oxford":1,"frq":606,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/28277288dd17f3fea5c960031035dc75.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["e","vi","dence"]},"flags":[]},
"evident":{"w":"evident","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 明显的；明白的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["明显的","明白的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈevidənt/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈevɪdənt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=evident&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Through the rich and colorful picture of their adventures, it became <B>evident</B> that their true strength was not in conquering the elements but in the unyielding bond they shared.","cn":"","src":"2023·上海（秋考）·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（上海（秋考））· 阅读A","year":2023,"region":"上海（秋考）","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"It was <B>evident</B> that she had once been a beauty.","cn":"很显然的，她曾经是个美人。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"The threat of inflation is already <B>evident</B> in bond prices.","cn":"通货膨胀的威胁在证券价格上已经是明显可见的。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"It was <B>evident</B> that someone had gone through my possessions.","cn":"显然有人翻过我的物品。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"evidence","ph":"/ˈevidəns/","cn":"n. 证据，证明；迹象；明显；v. 证明"},{"w":"evidently","ph":"/ˈevidəntli/","cn":"adv. 明显地， 显然"},{"w":"evidentiary","ph":"/ˌevəˈdenʃəri/","cn":"adj. 证据的，与证据有关的；用作证据的或基于"},{"w":"evidential","ph":"/ˌevɪˈdenʃl/","cn":"adj. 证据的；基于证据的；提供证据的，可作证"}],"syn":["apparent","manifest","patent","plain"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":3466,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/evident.webp","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["e","vi","dent"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
"evolution":{"w":"evolution","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 演变；进化论；进展","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["演变","进化论","进展"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/.iːvəˈluːʃən/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˌevəˈluːʃ(ə)n/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=evolution&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"He suspects it was <B>evolution</B> in other animals that caused the change.","cn":"","src":"2013·江苏·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读C","year":2013,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"We are the products of <B>evolution</B>, and not just evolution that occurred billions of years ago.","cn":"","src":"2020·新课标Ⅲ卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2020年高考英语（新课标Ⅲ卷）· 阅读D","year":2020,"region":"新课标Ⅲ卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"The practical benefits of open-ended <B>evolution</B> could be significant, from developing new medicines to creating more intelligent robots.","cn":"","src":"2023·北京·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（北京）· 阅读D","year":2023,"region":"北京","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"A heated debate has enlivened recent studies of <B>evolution</B>.","cn":"一场激烈的辩论使最近的进化论研究领域开始活跃起来。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"evolve","ph":"/iˈvɒlv/","cn":"v. 使发展"},{"w":"evolutionary","ph":"/,iːvəˈluːʃənəri/","cn":"adj. 演变的，进化的"},{"w":"evolutionism","ph":"/ˌevəˈluːʃənɪzəm/","cn":"n. [进化] 进化论；adj. 进化论的"},{"w":"evolutionist","ph":"/ˌevəˈluːʃənɪst/","cn":"n. 进化论者；adj. 进化论的"}],"syn":["development"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":2946,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/evolution.webp","syl":{"n":4,"s":2,"l":["e","vo","lu","tion"]},"flags":[]},
