"fairness":{"w":"fairness","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 公平；美好；清晰；顺利性","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["公平","美好","清晰","顺利性"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈfєənis/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈfernəs/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=fairness&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Typically, cruelty and cheating are universally condemned, while honesty and <B>fairness</B> are praised.","cn":"","src":"2024·北京·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2024年高考英语（北京）· 阅读D","year":2024,"region":"北京","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"It's as if the company is trying to ease our impatience with <B>fairness</B>.","cn":"","src":"2013·江苏·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读B","year":2013,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"Americans have an innate sense of <B>fairness</B>.","cn":"美国人有一种天生的公平感。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"In all <B>fairness</B> he had to admit that she was neither dishonest nor lazy.","cn":"公正地说，他不得不承认她既非不诚实也非懒惰。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"fair","ph":"/fєə/","cn":"adj. 公平的；美丽的，白皙的；[气象] 晴朗的；ad"},{"w":"fairly","ph":"/ˈfєəli/","cn":"adv. 相当地；公平地；简直；n. (Fairly)人"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":5954,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/70633e79ec38c84ce43994ccb3ccb5a6.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["fair","ness"]},"flags":[]},
