"fancy":{"w":"fancy","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 幻想；想象力；爱好；adj. 想象的；奇特的；昂贵的；精选的；v. 想象；喜爱；设想；自负","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["幻想","想象力","爱好"]},{"pos":"adj","cn":["想象的","奇特的","昂贵的","精选的"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["想象","喜爱","设想","自负"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈfænsi/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈfænsi/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=fancy&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"As soon as someone spotted the boat, everyone would do last-minute tidying and change into <B>fancy</B> clothes.","cn":"","src":"2015·湖南·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2015年高考英语（湖南）· 阅读C","year":2015,"region":"湖南","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Some of us used parts of those <B>fancy</B> paper napkins， while others used nothing but colored construction paper.","cn":"","src":"2009·广东·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2009年高考英语（广东）· 阅读B","year":2009,"region":"广东","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"But the phrase \"penny paper \" caught the public's <B>fancy</B>, and soon there would be papers that did indeed sell for only a penny.","cn":"","src":"2019·新课标Ⅲ卷·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2019年高考英语（新课标Ⅲ卷）· 阅读C","year":2019,"region":"新课标Ⅲ卷","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"A little of what you <B>fancy</B> does you good.","cn":"来一点你喜欢的东西对你是有好处的。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"fan","ph":"/fæn/","cn":"v. 煽动；刺激；吹拂；n. 迷；风扇；爱好者"},{"w":"fancied","ph":"/ˈfænsɪd/","cn":"adj. 空想的，想象的，虚构的；受喜爱的，被特"},{"w":"fanlike","ph":"/ˈfænˌlaɪk/","cn":"adj. 扇状的；折叠的"},{"w":"fancier","ph":"/ˈfænsiər/","cn":"n. 爱好者，发烧友，…迷；育种者，饲养爱好者（"},{"w":"fanning","ph":"/ˈfænɪŋ/","cn":"v. fan 的现在分词：吹，扇（风），给…扇风"},{"w":"fandom","ph":"/ˈfændəm/","cn":"n. （统称）粉丝，迷友，粉丝群体（如运动迷、影"}],"syn":["illusion","fantasy"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts"],"collins":1,"oxford":1,"frq":5118,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/fancy.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["fan","cy"]},"flags":[]},
