"flaming":{"w":"flaming","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 燃烧的；火红的；激昂的；v. 燃烧；变亮；发光（flame的ing形式）；n. (Flaming)人名；(法)弗拉曼","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["燃烧的","火红的","激昂的"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["燃烧","变亮","发光（flame的ing形式）"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["(Flaming)人名","(法)弗拉曼"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈfleimiŋ/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈfleɪmɪŋ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=flaming&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"The rocky peaks were <B>flaming</B> in the brilliant light, the snow-fields glowed and rosy clouds were floating overhead.","cn":"在明亮的光下，岩石山峰好像在燃烧着，雪原闪耀着光芒，玫瑰色的云彩漂浮在天空上。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Scotland's final flourish was a <B>flaming</B> sunset over the North Sea, oil RIGS like Aladdin's lamps staked across the horizon.","cn":"苏格兰最后的辉煌是北海落日的余晖，地平线上矗立着的石油井架犹如阿拉丁的灯火。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Other ancient civilisations certainly knew about kites; as early as 1250 BC, the Chinese were using them to deliver messages and dump <B>flaming</B> debris on their foes.","cn":"其他古代文明当然也了解风筝的用途；早在公元前1250年，中国人就用它们传递信息，向敌人投掷燃烧的碎片。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Hoping to allay parental fears, Frito-Lay has now introduced the slightly healthier baked <B>Flaming</B> Hot Cheetos.","cn":"","src":"NPR","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · NPR"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"flame","ph":"/fleim/","cn":"n. 火焰；热情；光辉；v. 焚烧；泛红"},{"w":"flamboyant","ph":"/flæmˈbɔɪənt/","cn":"adj. 艳丽的，艳丽夺目的；华丽张扬的，炫耀的"},{"w":"flamethrower","ph":"/ˈfleɪmθroʊər/","cn":"n. 火焰喷射器，喷火器；<喻>言辞激烈的人，好"}],"syn":["fire","flame"]},"tag":["gk"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":12654,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/2c26a07990d16a5ce7e91bbd803d620b.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["fla","ming"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
