"flesh":{"w":"flesh","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 肉；肉体；v. 喂肉给…；使发胖","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["肉","肉体"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["喂肉给…","使发胖"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈfleʃ/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/fleʃ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=flesh&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Memories <B>fleshed</B> through his mind like an old newsreel as he sat quietly remembering his childhood days.","cn":"","src":"2008·江苏·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读D","year":2008,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"After a period of calm within the Sun, scientists have detected the signs of a\u0001 <B>flesh</B> cycle of sunspots that could peak in 2012, just in time for the arrival of the Olympic torch in London.","cn":"","src":"2010·上海（秋考）·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2010年高考英语（上海（秋考））· 阅读C","year":2010,"region":"上海（秋考）","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Tigers are <B>flesh</B>-eating animals.","cn":"虎是食肉动物。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"It makes my <B>flesh</B> creep to think of it.","cn":"一想起它我就心惊肉跳。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"fleshy","ph":"/ˈfleʃi/","cn":"adj. 丰满的，略显肥胖的；肉质的，肥厚的；肉"},{"w":"fleshly","ph":"/ˈfleʃli/","cn":"adj. 肉体的；肉欲的；耽于声色的"},{"w":"fleshiness","ph":"/ˈfleʃɪnɪs/","cn":"n. 多肉；肥胖"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","ky","ielts"],"collins":2,"oxford":1,"frq":3209,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/d917c8d5f9f32327b7bb228b2d69b23e.png?","syl":{"n":1,"s":0,"l":["flesh"]},"flags":[]},
