"fond":{"w":"fond","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 喜欢的；温柔的；宠爱的；n. (Fond)人名；(法)丰；(瑞典)丰德","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["喜欢的","温柔的","宠爱的"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["(Fond)人名","(法)丰","(瑞典)丰德"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/fɒnd/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/fɑːnd/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=fond&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"One of the features of Jurassic oceans was an abundance of large sharks and crocodiles, both of which were <B>fond</B> of ichthyosaur lunches.","cn":"","src":"2013·江苏·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读C","year":2013,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"A gentleman once had a cat of which he was very <B>fond</B>.","cn":"","src":"九年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"I have grown very <B>fond</B> of Alec.","cn":"我已变得很喜欢亚力克。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Over the years, I have grown quite <B>fond</B> of her.","cn":"经过这么多年，我越来越喜欢她了。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"fondly","ph":"/ˈfɑːndli/","cn":"adv. 深情地，怜爱地，温柔地；天真地，轻信地"},{"w":"fondness","ph":"/ˈfɑːndnəs/","cn":"n. 爱好；喜爱"},{"w":"fondling","ph":"/ˈfɑːndlɪŋ/","cn":"v. 爱抚，抚弄（fondle 的现在分词或动名"},{"w":"fondle","ph":"/ˈfɑːnd(ə)l/","cn":"v. 轻抚，抚弄（某物）；爱抚，抚摸（某人）；n"}],"syn":["tender"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":6241,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/fond.webp","syl":{"n":1,"s":0,"l":["fond"]},"flags":[]},
"foolish":{"w":"foolish","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 愚蠢的；傻的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["愚蠢的","傻的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈfuːliʃ/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈfuːlɪʃ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=foolish&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Customer care is obviously here to stay and it would be a <B>foolish</B> company that used slogans such as \"we do as we please\".","cn":"","src":"2011·浙江·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读C","year":2011,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Though this seems strange and <B>foolish</B> they thought it was good way of finding out truth.","cn":"","src":"八年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"” “He must have wished that,” Sonny said, “Otherwise how could he be so <B>foolish</B> as to race with the hare?","cn":"","src":"八年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"It would be <B>foolish</B> to raise hopes unnecessarily.","cn":"无缘无故地寄托希望是愚蠢的。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"fool","ph":"/fuːl/","cn":"v. 欺骗，愚弄；干蠢事；adj. 愚蠢的；n. 蠢人，"},{"w":"foolishly","ph":"/ˈfuːlɪʃli/","cn":"adv. 愚蠢地，不明智地，愚笨地"},{"w":"fooling","ph":"/ˈfuːlɪŋ/","cn":"n. 开玩笑的言行；戏谑；v. 愚弄（fool "},{"w":"foolishness","ph":"/ˈfuːlɪʃnəs/","cn":"n. 愚蠢，愚昧；蠢事，愚蠢行为；可笑，荒唐"},{"w":"foolery","ph":"/ˈfʊləri/","cn":"n. 愚蠢的行为；愚蠢；蠢事"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","ky","toefl"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":5783,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/foolish.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["foo","lish"]},"flags":[]},
