"framework":{"w":"framework","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 框架，骨架；结构，构架","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["框架","骨架","结构","构架"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈfreimwəːk/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈfreɪmwɜːrk/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=framework&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Learn not just the business theories of today but the business <B>framework</B> of tomorrow from the most acclaimed faculty in the world.","cn":"跟随世界上最著名的教师，不仅要学习现在的商业理论，还要学习未来的商业框架。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"When parents talk with children about \"what we did today\" or \"last week\" or \"last year\", they guide the children's formation of a <B>framework</B> for talking about the past.","cn":"当父母与孩子谈论“我们今天做了什么”、“上周做了什么”或“去年做了什么”时，他们在引导孩子构造一个谈论过去的框架。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"We need to establish a legal <B>framework</B> for the protection of the environment.","cn":"我们需要建立一个法律体制来保护环境。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"His government prepared for negotiations by pushing through a constitutional amendment setting out a legal <B>framework</B> for peace.","cn":"","src":"ECONOMIST","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · ECONOMIST"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"frame","ph":"/freim/","cn":"n. 框架"},{"w":"framed","ph":"/freɪmd/","cn":"adj. 遭到陷害的，被诬陷的；（图画、照片等）"},{"w":"framing","ph":"/ˈfreɪmɪŋ/","cn":"n. 框架，构架；装框，加框；（摄影、影视）取景"},{"w":"framer","ph":"/ˈfreɪmər/","cn":"n. 制框者，画框制作人；制定者，起草者，筹划者"}],"syn":["model"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":2968,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/framework.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["frame","work"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
