"glasshouse":{"w":"glasshouse","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 温室；暖房","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["温室","暖房"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈglɑːshaus/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈɡlæshaʊs/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=glasshouse&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"BrightFarms, for example, together with a firm called Better Food Solutions, began constructing a large single-storey <B>glasshouse</B> on the roof of a big supermarket in October.","cn":"比如，光明农场系统公司现在正在和一家名为“好上好食品”（BetterFood Solutions）的公司合作，自10月份开始在一家大超市的屋顶上建造一座单层的大温室。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"You must grow these tropical flowers in a <B>glasshouse</B>.","cn":"你必须把这些热带花卉种在温室里。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"And in winter it works like a <B>glasshouse</B>, which keeps off the severe cold.","cn":"而在冬天，它就起到温室的作用，可以抵御严寒。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"An Historic <B>Glasshouse</B> Apprenticeship Scheme will also train a new generation in heritage restoration and horticulture.","cn":"","src":"BBC","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · BBC"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":["greenhouse"]},"tag":["gk"],"collins":0,"oxford":0,"frq":39029,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/6159489cf833d9a0333a277b68b06933.jpg?","syl":null,"flags":["no_exam_ex","no_syl"]},
