"glory":{"w":"glory","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 光荣，荣誉；赞颂；v. 自豪，骄傲；狂喜","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["光荣","荣誉","赞颂"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["自豪","骄傲","狂喜"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈglɒːri/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈɡlɔːri/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=glory&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Then you can say, \"I stand on the shoulders of my ancestors' tragedies and <B>glory</B>, and know that they are cheering on.\"","cn":"","src":"2011·天津·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（天津）· 阅读D","year":2011,"region":"天津","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"She wanted to enjoy her moment of <B>glory</B>.","cn":"她希望尽情享受自己的光荣时刻。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"The cathedral is the crowning <B>glory</B> of the city.","cn":"大教堂是这座城市至高无上的骄傲。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"The house has now been restored to its former <B>glory</B>.","cn":"这栋房子又恢复了它往日的辉煌。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"glorious","ph":"/ˈglɒːriəs/","cn":"adj. 辉煌的"},{"w":"glorify","ph":"/ˈglɒːrifai/","cn":"v. 赞美；颂扬（上帝）"},{"w":"glorified","ph":"/ˈɡlɔːrɪfaɪd/","cn":"adj. 美其名的，被美化的（常作定语，含贬义，"},{"w":"gloriously","ph":"/ˈɡlɔːriəsli/","cn":"adv. 光荣地，荣耀地；辉煌地，壮丽地，壮观地"},{"w":"glorification","ph":"/ˌɡlɔːrɪfɪˈkeɪʃn/","cn":"n. 赞颂，赞美，颂扬；美化，理想化；（宗教）荣"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":4113,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/9767ee3308c000a35ae5b29c037ea864.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["glo","ry"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
