"headmaster":{"w":"headmaster","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 校长","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["校长"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈhedˈmɑːstə/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˌhedˈmæstər/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=headmaster&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"But the <B>headmaster</B> tried to prevent them from doing so, saying regular school couldn't take care of a special needs students.","cn":"","src":"2008·浙江·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读A","year":2008,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"\"My teacher was angry and she sent me to the <B>headmaster</B> after our lessons.\"","cn":"","src":"八年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"\"But why did your teacher tell you to see the <B>headmaster</B> then?\"","cn":"","src":"八年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"He was <B>headmaster</B> of a public school in the West of England.","cn":"他曾是英格兰西部一所公学的校长。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"headmistress","ph":"/ˈhedˈmistris/","cn":"n. 女校长"}],"syn":["master"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","ielts"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":16726,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/6f5bc1f5597aaa8b52499519a08ea9c4.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":1,"l":["head","ma","ster"]},"flags":[]},
