"hive":{"w":"hive","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 群居；入蜂房；生活在蜂房中；n. 蜂房，蜂巢；热闹的场所；熙攘喧闹的人群","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["群居","入蜂房","生活在蜂房中"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["蜂房","蜂巢","热闹的场所","熙攘喧闹的人群"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/haiv/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/haɪv/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=hive&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"A dark cloud of bees comes swarming out of the <B>hive</B>.","cn":"黑压压的一大群蜜蜂从那座蜂巢涌过来。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Glass hives offer a close-up view of the bees at work, with the queen bee in each <B>hive</B> marked by a white dot.","cn":"玻璃蜂房可以近距离观察工作中的蜜蜂，每个蜂房的蜂王都被打上白点标记。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Tapping on the <B>hive</B> excited the bees.","cn":"轻敲蜂箱使蜜蜂兴奋。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"The ski village, however, while a welcome <B>hive</B> of activity, has long been an architectural hodgepodge.","cn":"","src":"FORBES","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · FORBES"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","toefl","gre"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":11401,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/82b1437885966ca1b6c8b672da5d38c3.jpg?","syl":{"n":1,"s":0,"l":["hive"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","fam_gap"]},
"holy":{"w":"holy","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 圣洁的，神圣的；至善的；n. 神圣的东西","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["圣洁的","神圣的","至善的"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["神圣的东西"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈhəuli/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈhoʊli/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=holy&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"We bless your <B>holy</B> name, O Lord.","cn":"主啊，我们颂扬您的圣名。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"In him our hearts rejoice, for we trust in his <B>holy</B> name.","cn":"我们的心必靠他欢喜，因为我们倚靠他的圣名。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Here, in this <B>holy</B> place, here if anywhere, surely we shall find Him!","cn":"如果有任何一个地方我们肯定能找到他，就是这里，这块圣地！","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"These <B>holy</B> places and the nearby Neolithic sites are an incomparable testimony to prehistoric times.","cn":"","src":"UNESCO","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · UNESCO"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"holiness","ph":"/ˈhoʊlinəs/","cn":"n. 神圣，圣洁；陛下，圣座（对教皇的尊称）"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":2375,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/a149c05fd79ac35e4fa1b4603daee565.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["ho","ly"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","fam_gap"]},
"honour":{"w":"honour","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 荣誉；尊敬；勋章；v. 尊敬；[金融] 承兑；承兑远期票据","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["荣誉","尊敬","勋章"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["尊敬","[金融] 承兑","承兑远期票据"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈɒnə/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈɑːnər/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=honour&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"For example, \"colour\" and \"<B>honour</B>\" are British English spellings, \"color\" and \"honor\" are American English spellings.","cn":"","src":"七年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"It was a great <B>honour</B> to be invited here today.","cn":"今天承蒙邀请到此，深感荣幸。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"This award is considered (to be) a great <B>honour</B>.","cn":"这项奖被视为极大的荣誉。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"It is indeed an <B>honour</B> to serve my country in such an esteemed position.","cn":"在如此受人尊敬的岗位上为我的国家服务实属一种荣誉。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"honor","ph":"/ˈɒnə/","cn":"v. 尊敬；n. 尊敬，敬意；荣誉，光荣"},{"w":"honorary","ph":"/ˈɒnərəri/","cn":"adj. 荣誉的"},{"w":"honored","ph":"/ˈɑːnərd/","cn":"adj. 光荣的，荣幸的；受尊敬的；（票据）已承"},{"w":"honorable","ph":"/ˈɑːnərəb(ə)l/","cn":"adj. 光荣的；可敬的；高贵的；正直的，值得尊"},{"w":"honorific","ph":"/ˌɑːnəˈrɪfɪk/","cn":"adj. 尊敬的，表示敬意的，敬称的；n. 敬称"},{"w":"honorably","ph":"/ˈɑːnərəbli/","cn":"adv. 体面地，值得尊敬地；光荣地"}],"syn":["honor"]},"tag":["zk","gk","cet4","cet6"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":32290,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/honour.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["ho","nour"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
