"hooray":{"w":"hooray","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"vi. 呼万岁；vt. 呼万岁；n. 万岁","senses":[{"pos":"vi","cn":["呼万岁"]},{"pos":"vt","cn":["呼万岁"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["万岁"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/huˈrei/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/huˈreɪ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=hooray&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Supper's here at last, <B>hooray</B>!","cn":"晚饭终于来了，万岁！","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"If that worked, we should say <B>hooray</B>! If not, we will soldier on to the next step.","cn":"如果成功了，我们应该说万岁！如果没有，我们将坚持到下一步。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"If you're feeling really good, shout <B>hooray</B>!","cn":"如果你感觉很好，大声欢呼吧！","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"So, <B>hooray</B> for ACOs, and let's keep inching toward true competition in health services.","cn":"","src":"WSJ","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · WSJ"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk"],"collins":0,"oxford":0,"frq":23679,"img":"","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["hoo","ray"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","no_img","fam_gap"]},
