"jog":{"w":"jog","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 慢跑；轻推；蹒跚行进；使颠簸；n. 慢跑；轻推，轻撞","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["慢跑","轻推","蹒跚行进","使颠簸"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["慢跑","轻推","轻撞"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/dʒɒg/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/dʒɑːɡ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=jog&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Well, I had nothing against feeling great and if Alex could <B>jog</B> every day, anyone could.","cn":"","src":"2008·浙江·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读D","year":2008,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"Plan to go for a <B>jog</B> together.","cn":"","src":"2015·福建·阅读E","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2015年高考英语（福建）· 阅读E","year":2015,"region":"福建","section":"阅读E"},{"en":"So I took up <B>jogging</B> seriously and gave it a good two months of my life, and not a day more.","cn":"","src":"2008·浙江·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读D","year":2008,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"I like to go for a <B>jog</B> after work.","cn":"我喜欢在下班后慢跑锻炼。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"jogging","ph":"/ˈdʒɑːɡɪŋ/","cn":"n. 慢跑锻炼；v. 慢跑；轻推，轻撞；（多指缓"},{"w":"jogger","ph":"/ˈdʒɑːɡər/","cn":"n. 慢跑者；（印刷）撞纸机"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":8335,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/3a7715970949695e02e5bbff466b0618.png?","syl":{"n":1,"s":0,"l":["jog"]},"flags":[]},
