"judge":{"w":"judge","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 判断；审判；n. 法官；裁判员","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["判断","审判"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["法官","裁判员"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/dʒʌdʒ/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/dʒʌdʒ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=judge&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"And I've learnt a good lesson: not to <B>judge</B> people.","cn":"","src":"2010·北京·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2010年高考英语（北京）· 阅读A","year":2010,"region":"北京","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"We have some advice for the two parties: publish the report, and let the country be the <B>judge</B>.","cn":"","src":"2014·福建·阅读E","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（福建）· 阅读E","year":2014,"region":"福建","section":"阅读E"},{"en":"<B>Judging</B> someone to be either \"warm\" or \"cold\" is a primary consideration, even trumping evidence that a \"cold\" person may be more capable.","cn":"","src":"2009·天津·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2009年高考英语（天津）· 阅读D","year":2009,"region":"天津","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"He knows better than to <B>judge</B> by appearances.","cn":"他明白得很，绝不会凭表面现象来判断。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"judgement","ph":"/ˈdʒʌdʒmənt/","cn":"n. 意见；判断力；[法] 审判；评价"},{"w":"judicial","ph":"/dʒuːˈdiʃəl/","cn":"adj. 司法的"},{"w":"judging","ph":"/dʒʌdʒɪŋ/","cn":"vt. 判断；审判（judge 的现在分词）；v"},{"w":"judgmental","ph":"/dʒʌdʒˈmentl/","cn":"adj. （含贬义）好对人或事评头论足的，动辄妄"},{"w":"judicable","ph":"/ˈdʒʊdɪkəbl/","cn":"adj. 应受审判的；可被审判的"},{"w":"judicatory","ph":"/ˈdʒuːdɪkəˌtɔːri/","cn":"adj. 司法的；判决的；n. 法院，法庭；法院"}],"syn":["justice"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky"],"collins":4,"oxford":1,"frq":1115,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/3e5cfc9c63ada8776e171bed236c80c8.png?","syl":{"n":1,"s":0,"l":["judge"]},"flags":[]},
