"latter":{"w":"latter","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 后者的；近来的；后面的；较后的；n. (Latter)人名；(英、德、捷)拉特","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["后者的","近来的","后面的","较后的"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["(Latter)人名","(英","德","捷)拉特"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈlætə/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈlætər/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=latter&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"The exercises can be fun and a good warm-up for the <B>latter</B> part of the programme.","cn":"这些练习很有趣，还可以为后面的课程做热身准备。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"The former offers more excitement and convenience while the <B>latter</B> offers a cleaner, quieter and often friendlier place to live.","cn":"前者提供了更多的刺激和便利，而后者提供了一个更干净、更安静、通常也更友好的居住环境。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"If the <B>latter</B> is the case, increasing face-to-face time with trusted friends, and minimizing time scrolling online, will prove to be a reminder that your social network is much more rewarding than any \"like\", \"follow\" or \"share\" can be.","cn":"如果是后者，那就多和信任的朋友见面，减少上网时间，这样会发现你的人脉比网上那些“点赞”、“关注”、“分享”都来得有价值。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"More than half think the Fed will hike rates in the <B>latter</B> half of the year.","cn":"","src":"FORBES","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · FORBES"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"latterly","ph":"/ˈlætərli/","cn":"adv. （书面）最近，近来；（指一段时期或活动"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":2725,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/latter.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["lat","ter"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","fam_gap"]},
