"liberate":{"w":"liberate","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 解放；放出；释放","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["解放","放出","释放"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈlibəreit/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈlɪbəreɪt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=liberate&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Nitrogen dissolved in his blood is suddenly <B>liberated</B> by the reduction of pressure.","cn":"","src":"2013·江苏·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读C","year":2013,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"They planned to march on and <B>liberate</B> the city.","cn":"他们打算继续前进解放这座城市。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Today the move is to <B>liberate</B> the woman, which may in the end strengthen the marriage union.","cn":"今天的行动是解放妇女，这最终可能会加强婚姻联盟。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"These devices then combine hydrogen and oxygen to make water and <B>liberate</B> electricity in the process.","cn":"然后这些装置将氢和氧合成水，并在这个过程中释放电力。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"liberation","ph":"/.libəˈreiʃən/","cn":"n. 释放，解放"},{"w":"liberated","ph":"/ˈlɪbəreɪtɪd/","cn":"adj. 被解放的，获得自由的；思想解放的，无拘"},{"w":"liberator","ph":"/ˈlɪbəreɪtər/","cn":"n. 解放者；释放者；n. （Liberator"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","gre"],"collins":3,"oxford":0,"frq":7492,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/657ed3a884b87d7b7f1a749e3c6f84fa.png?","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["li","ber","ate"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
"liberation":{"w":"liberation","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 释放，解放","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["释放","解放"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/.libəˈreiʃən/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˌlɪbəˈreɪʃ(ə)n/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=liberation&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"We call this data <B>liberation</B>.","cn":"我们管这叫“数据解放”。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"We firmly support the Asian, African and Latin American people in their struggle for <B>liberation</B>!","cn":"我们坚决支持亚洲、非洲、拉丁美洲各国人民的解放斗争。","src":"新英汉","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《新英汉大辞典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"As far as manners are concerned, I suppose I have always been a supporter of women's <B>liberation</B>.","cn":"就礼仪而言，我想我一直是妇女解放运动的支持者。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Kurzweil's human-machine symbiosis is not a techno-catastrophe but the ultimate <B>liberation</B> from humanity's biological frailties.","cn":"","src":"CNN","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · CNN"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"liberate","ph":"/ˈlibəreit/","cn":"v. 解放；放出；释放"},{"w":"liberated","ph":"/ˈlɪbəreɪtɪd/","cn":"adj. 被解放的，获得自由的；思想解放的，无拘"},{"w":"liberator","ph":"/ˈlɪbəreɪtər/","cn":"n. 解放者；释放者；n. （Liberator"}],"syn":["release"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6"],"collins":0,"oxford":0,"frq":6230,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/7f307c92ae9c5f4a467b96f6276f55d4.jpg?","syl":{"n":4,"s":2,"l":["li","ber","a","tion"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
"liberty":{"w":"liberty","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 自由；许可；冒失","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["自由","许可","冒失"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈlibəli/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈlɪbərti/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=liberty&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Then, we sat and watched The Music Man followed by The Man Who Shot <B>Liberty</B> Valance.","cn":"","src":"2014·山东·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（山东）· 阅读B","year":2014,"region":"山东","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"When I was 45 years old I raced — and beat — a teenage football player the 168 steps up the Statue of <B>Liberty</B>.","cn":"","src":"2014·天津·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（天津）· 阅读D","year":2014,"region":"天津","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"The essential belief of the first free government in the world was <B>liberty</B> for all men who could control themselves and would take responsibility for the state.","cn":"","src":"2015·江苏·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2015年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读D","year":2015,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"He firmly believes <B>liberty</B> is inseparable from social justice.","cn":"他坚信自由与社会正义是不可分开的。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"liberal","ph":"/ˈlibərəl/","cn":"adj. 心胸宽大的；慷慨的"},{"w":"libertine","ph":"/ˈlɪbərtiːn/","cn":"n. 浪荡子，性行为放纵者，放荡不羁者；（旧）自"},{"w":"libertarian","ph":"/ˌlɪbərˈteriən/","cn":"n. （政治哲学，可数名词）自由意志主义者，自由"},{"w":"liberally","ph":"/ˈlɪbərəli/","cn":"adv. 慷慨地，大方地；大量地，充足地；自由地"},{"w":"libertarianism","ph":"/ˌlɪbərˈterɪənɪzəm/","cn":"n. 自由至上主义，自由意志主义（主张个人自由、"},{"w":"liberalize","ph":"/ˈlɪbrəlaɪz/","cn":"vt. 使（法律、政策、制度等）自由化，放宽限制"}],"syn":["autonomy"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","gre"],"collins":3,"oxford":0,"frq":3835,"img":"","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["li","ber","ty"]},"flags":["no_img"]},
