"merry":{"w":"merry","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 愉快的；微醉的；嬉戏作乐的；n. 甜樱桃","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["愉快的","微醉的","嬉戏作乐的"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["甜樱桃"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈmeri/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈmeri/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=merry&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"You don't really understand human nature unless you know why a child on a <B>merry</B>-go-round will wave at his parents every time around.","cn":"你不会真正了解人性，除非你能理解为什么玩旋转木马的孩子会每转一圈就向他们的父母挥挥手\n。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"She was humming a <B>merry</B> little tune.","cn":"她轻轻地哼着一首欢快的小曲儿。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"From the house come bursts of <B>merry</B> laughter.","cn":"从房子里传出阵阵欢快的笑声。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"So what if on our <B>merry</B> way we get heckled by a few local, erm, imbibers?","cn":"","src":"BBC","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · BBC"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"merrymaking","ph":"/ˈmerimeɪkɪŋ/","cn":"n. 狂欢者；寻欢作乐；adj. 狂欢的；快乐的"},{"w":"mirthful","ph":"/ˈmɜːθfəl/","cn":"adj. 愉快的，高兴的；令人欢乐的，惹人发笑的"},{"w":"mirthless","ph":"/ˈmɜːrθləs/","cn":"adj. 不快乐的，悲伤的，阴郁的（指缺乏真正的"},{"w":"merrily","ph":"/ˈmerəli/","cn":"adv. 愉快地，高兴地，欢乐地（merry 的"},{"w":"mirthfully","ph":"","cn":"adv. 愉快地；热闹地；喜气洋洋地"},{"w":"mirth","ph":"/mɜːrθ/","cn":"n. （文学）欢笑，欢乐，高兴"}],"syn":["gay","jolly"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":7420,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/ca30081bbd36f6945ff4034b0a51a89c.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["mer","ry"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
