"niece":{"w":"niece","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 外甥女，侄女","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["外甥女","侄女"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/niːs/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/niːs/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=niece&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Today Aunt Myrtle is still an enthusiastic supporter of her \"favourite <B>niece</B>\".","cn":"","src":"2011·上海·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（上海）· 阅读A","year":2011,"region":"上海","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"He looked affectionately at his <B>niece</B>.","cn":"他慈爱地看着他的侄女。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"She was not exactly overjoyed at the prospect of looking after her <B>niece</B>.","cn":"想到要照料她的侄女，她就高兴不起来了。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Now she's in assisted living, and her <B>niece</B> and nephew are helping with her affairs.","cn":"她现在住在辅助生活型住房里，她的侄女和侄子在帮助处理她的事务。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky"],"collins":1,"oxford":1,"frq":7475,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/niece.webp","syl":{"n":1,"s":0,"l":["niece"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex","fam_gap"]},
