"obtain":{"w":"obtain","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 获得；流行","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["获得","流行"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/əbˈtein/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/əbˈteɪn/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=obtain&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"However, another is fast <B>obtaining</B> an advantage: \"value for time.\"","cn":"","src":"2014·江苏·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读B","year":2014,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"However, <B>obtaining</B> items that are rare, recently published or in high demand may take longer.","cn":"","src":"2025·浙江（1月）·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2025年高考英语（浙江（1月））· 阅读A","year":2025,"region":"浙江（1月）","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"To <B>obtain</B> the article or chapter, click on the link provided in the email and log into your ILL account.","cn":"","src":"2025·浙江（1月）·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2025年高考英语（浙江（1月））· 阅读A","year":2025,"region":"浙江（1月）","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"I could <B>obtain</B> with the snap of my fingers anything I chose.","cn":"只要打一下响指，我就可以得到我选中的任何东西。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"obtainable","ph":"/əbˈteɪnəb(ə)l/","cn":"adj. 能得到的，可获得的"},{"w":"obtainment","ph":"","cn":"n. 获得，取得"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":1595,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/2e722f36ce399287552e6ec57cc406a9.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["ob","tain"]},"flags":[]},
"obvious":{"w":"obvious","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 明显的；显著的；平淡无奇的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["明显的","显著的","平淡无奇的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈɒbviəs/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈɑːbviəs/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=obvious&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"There are no <B>obvious</B> limits to the escalation of demands for quality.","cn":"","src":"2012·重庆·阅读E","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2012年高考英语（重庆）· 阅读E","year":2012,"region":"重庆","section":"阅读E"},{"en":"Such methods seem <B>obvious</B> yet so often we just don’t think.","cn":"","src":"2022·新高考Ⅰ卷·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2022年高考英语（新高考Ⅰ卷）· 阅读B","year":2022,"region":"新高考Ⅰ卷","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"People's hesitancy to delay satisfaction is the most <B>obvious</B> one.","cn":"","src":"2023·北京·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（北京）· 阅读C","year":2023,"region":"北京","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Despite the <B>obvious</B> setbacks, it is not all doom and gloom for the England team.","cn":"尽管明显受挫，但对英格兰队来说绝非胜利无望。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"obviously","ph":"/ˈɔbviəsli/","cn":"adv. 明显地，显然地"},{"w":"obviousness","ph":"/ˈɑːbviəsnəs/","cn":"n. 明显，显而易见，显著性；（专利法）显而易见"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":4,"oxford":1,"frq":1689,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/obvious.webp","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["ob","vi","ous"]},"flags":[]},
