"powder":{"w":"powder","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 粉；粉末；[化工][军] 火药；尘土；v. 使成粉末；撒粉；搽粉于","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["粉","粉末","[化工][军] 火药","尘土"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["使成粉末","撒粉","搽粉于"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈpaudə/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈpaʊdər/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=powder&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Tolstoy's Napoleon could be any man wandering in the streets and putting a little of <B>powdered</B> tobacco up his nose-and that is the point.","cn":"","src":"2008·广东·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（广东）· 阅读C","year":2008,"region":"广东","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"The study, by researchers from Seoul, South Korea, involved mice being fed with dried milk <B>powder</B> made from cows milked both during the day and at night.","cn":"","src":"2016·四川·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2016年高考英语（四川）· 阅读D","year":2016,"region":"四川","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"Now a famous store uses complex man-made smell to make sure that the soft scent of baby <B>powder</B> floats through the kid department, and coconut scent in the swimsuit section.","cn":"","src":"2014·北京·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（北京）· 阅读D","year":2014,"region":"北京","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"The snow was like <B>powder</B>.","cn":"雪像粉末一样。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"powdered","ph":"/ˈpaʊdərd/","cn":"adj. 粉状的，粉末状的，变成粉末的；涂粉的，"},{"w":"powdery","ph":"/ˈpaʊdəri/","cn":"adj. 粉的，粉状的，像粉末的；布满粉状物的，"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl"],"collins":2,"oxford":1,"frq":3260,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/24f3ea66c681cc8f1b0c87e888b379b2.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["pow","der"]},"flags":[]},
