"punctual":{"w":"punctual","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 准时的，守时的；精确的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["准时的","守时的","精确的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈpəŋktʃuəl/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈpʌŋktʃuəl/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=punctual&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"She has been reliable and <B>punctual</B>.","cn":"她一直可靠守时。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"He's always very <B>punctual</B>. I'll see if he's here yet.","cn":"他一向很准时。我要看看他是不是已经来了。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"First, they'd say I am very <B>punctual</B>.","cn":"首先，他们会说我很守时。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Nobody is ever <B>punctual</B>, for example, and eventually you get sucked into behaving like everyone else.","cn":"","src":"BBC","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · BBC"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"punctually","ph":"/ˈpʌŋktʃuəli/","cn":"adv. 准时地，守时地，如期地"},{"w":"punctuality","ph":"/ˌpʌŋktʃuˈæləti/","cn":"n. 准时性"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl","ielts"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":25334,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/c615beef4737c7d6ab749b4920cdf017.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["punc","tu","al"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
