"redirect":{"w":"redirect","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 使改方向；重新寄送；adj. 再直接的；n. 再直接询问","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["使改方向","重新寄送"]},{"pos":"adj","cn":["再直接的"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["再直接询问"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/.riːdiˈrekt/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˌriːdəˈrekt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=redirect&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Finally, governments can avoid the huge expenses that are taking us in the wrong direction, and <B>redirecting</B> some of those expenses can accelerate the change from traditional model to a sustainable one.","cn":"","src":"2011·广东·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（广东）· 阅读D","year":2011,"region":"广东","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"Often we have a prepared list in mind and wonder, as we listen, how we can achieve certain desired results to get the conversation over as quickly as possible or <B>redirected</B> in ways more satisfactory to us.","cn":"","src":"2013·江西·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（江西）· 阅读C","year":2013,"region":"江西","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Alvaro Luna, a professor of electrical engineering, said that the system is innovative in so far as it allows for recycled energy to be <B>redirected</B> to specific local uses — in this case powering electric cars parked nearby.","cn":"","src":"2026·全国Ⅱ卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2026年高考英语（全国Ⅱ卷）· 阅读D","year":2026,"region":"全国Ⅱ卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"If we <B>redirect</B> our attention toward cultivating inner qualities, we might find a magnetic attraction that moves us from something superficial to something that connects us to our depths.","cn":"如果我们将注意力转向培养内在品质，我们可能会发现一种磁性吸引力，将我们从关注肤浅的东西转移到关注与我们内心深处联系起来的东西。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","toefl","gre"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":11425,"img":"","syl":{"n":3,"s":2,"l":["re","dir","ect"]},"flags":["no_img","fam_gap"]},
"reduce":{"w":"reduce","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 减少；降低；使处于；把…分解","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["减少","降低","使处于","把…分解"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/riˈdjuːs/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ɹɪˈd͡ʒuːs/","usSrc":"Wiktionary"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reduce&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Eating just one carrot a day can <B>reduce</B> the possibility of getting this disease by 40%.","cn":"","src":"2009·陕西·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2009年高考英语（陕西）· 阅读C","year":2009,"region":"陕西","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"The number of cities producing CO beyond the standard has been <B>reduced</B> from 40 to 9.","cn":"","src":"2014·新课标Ⅱ卷·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（新课标Ⅱ卷）· 阅读B","year":2014,"region":"新课标Ⅱ卷","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"Glowing plants could <B>reduce</B> this distance and therefore help save energy.","cn":"","src":"2020·新课标Ⅰ卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2020年高考英语（新课标Ⅰ卷）· 阅读D","year":2020,"region":"新课标Ⅰ卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"We all need to look for ways to <B>reduce</B> our carbon footprint.","cn":"我们都需要寻找减少我们碳足迹的办法。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"reduction","ph":"/riˈdʌkʃən/","cn":"n. 减少，减小，缩减"},{"w":"reduced","ph":"/rɪˈdjʊst/","cn":"adj. 减少的；[数] 简化的；缩减的"},{"w":"reductive","ph":"/rɪˈdʌktɪv/","cn":"adj. 简单化的，过度简化的，化约的（常含贬义"},{"w":"reducible","ph":"/rɪˈduːsəbl/","cn":"adj. 可减少的，可降低的，可缩小的；可简化的"},{"w":"reducer","ph":"/rɪˈdusər/","cn":"n. 使某物减少、降低或变小的人或事物（常用于复"},{"w":"reducing","ph":"/rɪˈdʊsɪŋ/","cn":"v. 减少，降低；使（液体）变稠，收汁（redu"}],"syn":["trim","cut"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl"],"collins":4,"oxford":1,"frq":701,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/9f0f87d63e994fde7ee5e8e3f3b83cff.jpg?","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["re","duce"]},"flags":[]},
