"reference":{"w":"reference","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 参考，参照；涉及，提及；参考书目；介绍信；证明书；v. 引用","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["参考","参照","涉及","提及","参考书目"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["引用"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈrefərəns/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈrefrəns/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reference&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"His judgment and <B>references</B> are decidedly American, as well as his delicate stomach.","cn":"","src":"2020·山东·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2020年高考英语（山东）· 阅读C","year":2020,"region":"山东","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Quite often there is no official naming ceremony but places tend to be called names as points of <B>reference</B> by people.","cn":"","src":"2009·天津·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2009年高考英语（天津）· 阅读A","year":2009,"region":"天津","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"But elevation is necessarily relative: only the choice of a <B>reference</B> point allows us to express numerically the height of an object or a location.","cn":"","src":"2026·全国Ⅱ卷·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2026年高考英语（全国Ⅱ卷）· 阅读C","year":2026,"region":"全国Ⅱ卷","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"He made only a veiled <B>reference</B> to international concerns over human rights issues.","cn":"他只是含蓄地提及对人权问题的国际关注。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"refer","ph":"/riˈfəː/","cn":"v. 参考；涉及；提到；查阅"},{"w":"referee","ph":"/.refəˈriː/","cn":"n. 裁判员；调解人；介绍人；v. 仲裁；担任裁判"},{"w":"referenced","ph":"/ˈrefrənst/","cn":"adj. 引用的，参考的，有参考依据的；v. 引"},{"w":"referential","ph":"/ˌrefəˈrenʃl/","cn":"adj. 有所指的，指称的，与所指事物有关的；参"},{"w":"referable","ph":"/rɪˈfɜːrəblˌˈrefrəbl/","cn":"adj. （通常与 to 连用）可归因于……的，"},{"w":"referral","ph":"/rɪˈfɜːrəl/","cn":"n. 转送，转诊；（转给专科医生或专科医院的）转"}],"syn":["mention"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","ielts"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":1904,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/reference.webp","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["re","fer","ence"]},"flags":[]},
"reflect":{"w":"reflect","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 反映；反射，照出；表达；显示;反省","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["反映","反射","照出","表达","显示"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/riˈflekt/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/rɪˈflekt/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=reflect&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"\"I <B>reflect</B> on how my day's gone and think about the rest of the week,\" he said.","cn":"","src":"2019·新课标Ⅱ卷·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2019年高考英语（新课标Ⅱ卷）· 阅读C","year":2019,"region":"新课标Ⅱ卷","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Of the energy that reaches the lower atmosphere, 30% is <B>reflected</B> by clouds or the Earth's surface.","cn":"","src":"2008·江苏·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读B","year":2008,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"Don't most parents like to brag about their child's success because it <B>reflects</B> well upon them?","cn":"","src":"2020·上海春考·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2020年高考英语（上海春考）· 阅读A","year":2020,"region":"上海春考","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"We should all give ourselves time to <B>reflect</B>.","cn":"我们都应该给自己时间来深思。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"reflection","ph":"/riˈflekʃən/","cn":"n. 反射；映象；反映"},{"w":"reflective","ph":"/riˈflektiv/","cn":"adj. 深思熟虑的；反映的，反射的"},{"w":"reflected","ph":"/rɪˈflektɪd/","cn":"v. 反射（光、热或声音）；反映，照出（影像）；"},{"w":"reflecting","ph":"/rɪˈflektɪŋ/","cn":"v. 反射（光、热或声音）；反映，照出（影像）；"},{"w":"reflectively","ph":"/rɪˈflektɪvli/","cn":"adv. 反映地；反照地"},{"w":"reflector","ph":"/rɪˈflektər/","cn":"n. 反光器，反光面，反光罩；（装于自行车、汽车"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","gre"],"collins":4,"oxford":1,"frq":1004,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/a54a056f0e7392a41ead532fafa47311.png?","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["re","flect"]},"flags":[]},
