"regards":{"w":"regards","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 致意，问候；v. 视为，注意（regard的第三人称单数）","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["致意","问候"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["视为","注意（regard的第三人称单数）"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/rɪˈɡɑːdz/","ukSrc":"有道","us":"/rɪˈɡɑːrdz/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=regards&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Finally, as <B>regards</B> to smoking, it is against the law to buy cigarettes or tobacco if you are under 16 years of age.","cn":"","src":"九年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"I have little information as <B>regards</B> her fitness for the post.","cn":"至于说她是否适合这个职位，我无可奉告。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Please give him my <B>regards</B>.","cn":"请转达我对他的问候。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"It <B>regards</B> written contracts as unalterable.","cn":"它认为书面合同是不可更改的。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk"],"collins":0,"oxford":0,"frq":20654,"img":"","syl":{"n":2,"s":1,"l":["re","gards"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex","no_img","fam_gap"]},
