"ripen":{"w":"ripen","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 使成熟","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["使成熟"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈraipən/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈraɪpən/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=ripen&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"I'm waiting for the apples to <B>ripen</B>.","cn":"我在等这些苹果成熟。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"This helps to <B>ripen</B> new growth and makes it flower profusely.","cn":"这有助于新植物成熟并且开出繁茂的花朵。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Don't worry. Time will soon <B>ripen</B>.","cn":"别着急，时机即将成熟。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"This allowed them to mature more slowly, helping <B>ripen</B> the tannins and fruit evenly.","cn":"","src":"WSJ","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · WSJ"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"ripe","ph":"/raip/","cn":"adj. 熟的，成熟的；时机成熟的；vt. 搜查；调查；"},{"w":"ripely","ph":"/ˈraɪpli/","cn":"adv. 圆通地；成熟地"},{"w":"ripeness","ph":"/ˈraɪpnəs/","cn":"n. 成熟，成熟状态，成熟度；老练，圆通；完成；"}],"syn":["mature"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","toefl","gre"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":14750,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/00aacab2f832cb15b7647150f7e65a1b.png?","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["ri","pen"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
