"significance":{"w":"significance","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 意义；重要性；意思","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["意义","重要性","意思"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/sigˈnifikəns/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəns/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=significance&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"The decision means scientists have too little time to study bones and other human remains of national and cultural <B>significance</B>.","cn":"","src":"2011·上海·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（上海）· 阅读C","year":2011,"region":"上海","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Much of the real <B>significance</B> of railroads and highways is not in their direct physical effect on the scenery, but in the ways that they affect the surrounding community.","cn":"","src":"2011·北京·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（北京）· 阅读D","year":2011,"region":"北京","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"The <B>significance</B> of the research on cats and dogs may go beyond pets — to people who don't get along, including neighbors, colleagues at work, and even world superpowers.","cn":"","src":"2011·广东·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（广东）· 阅读B","year":2011,"region":"广东","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"The new drug has great <B>significance</B> for the treatment of the disease.","cn":"这种新药对于这种病的治疗有重大的意义。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"sign","ph":"/sain/","cn":"v. 签； 签署；n. 标志，符号；招牌；征兆，迹象"},{"w":"significant","ph":"/sigˈnifikənt/","cn":"adj. 重要的"},{"w":"signal","ph":"/ˈsignl/","cn":"n. 信号；暗号；导火线；v. 标志；用信号通知；表示；"},{"w":"signature","ph":"/ˈsignətʃə/","cn":"n. 署名；签名；信号"},{"w":"signify","ph":"/ˈsignifai/","cn":"v. 表明，象征"},{"w":"signed","ph":"/saɪnd/","cn":"adj. 已签字的，已签署的；（数学、计算机）有"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":2937,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/significance.webp","syl":{"n":4,"s":1,"l":["sig","ni","fi","cance"]},"flags":[]},
"simplify":{"w":"simplify","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 简化；使单纯；使简易","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["简化","使单纯","使简易"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈsimplifai/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=simplify&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Our aim is to <B>simplify</B> the complex social security system.","cn":"我们的目的是要简化复杂的社会保险体系。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Intelligent people can often <B>simplify</B> the complex.","cn":"聪明人往往能把复杂的事情简单化。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"While intelligent people can often <B>simplify</B> the complex, a fool is more likely to complicate the simple.","cn":"聪明的人往往能把复杂的事情简单化，而傻瓜更有可能把简单的事情复杂化。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"The aim is to improve performance and quality of service, reduce costs, and <B>simplify</B> management.","cn":"","src":"BBC","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · BBC"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"simply","ph":"/ˈsimpli/","cn":"adv. 简单地；仅仅；简直；朴素地；坦白地"},{"w":"simple","ph":"/ˈsimpl/","cn":"adj. 简单的；单纯的；天真的；n. 笨蛋；愚蠢的行为"},{"w":"simplicity","ph":"/simˈplisiti/","cn":"n. 简单"},{"w":"simplified","ph":"/ˈsɪmplɪfaɪd/","cn":"adj. 简化了的，简化的；v. 简化，精简（s"},{"w":"simplification","ph":"/ˌsɪmplɪfɪˈkeɪʃn/","cn":"n. 简化，简单化，单纯化；简化的事物，简化形式"},{"w":"simpleness","ph":"","cn":"n. 简单；单纯"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","ielts"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":8483,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/fec9bdcbab570dc4fd6ca7660aaa099d.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":0,"l":["sim","pli","fy"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
"simply":{"w":"simply","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adv. 简单地；仅仅；简直；朴素地；坦白地","senses":[{"pos":"adv","cn":["简单地","仅仅","简直","朴素地","坦白地"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈsimpli/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈsɪmpli/","usSrc":"Wiktionary"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=simply&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"But he is not content to <B>simply</B> record these voices before they disappear without record.","cn":"","src":"2014·新课标Ⅰ卷·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（新课标Ⅰ卷）· 阅读D","year":2014,"region":"新课标Ⅰ卷","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"\"Perhaps he <B>simply</B> needs someone to share his pain with,\" I thought.","cn":"","src":"2013·广东·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（广东）· 阅读C","year":2013,"region":"广东","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"When he spoke, he said <B>simply</B>, without accusation, \"You had nothing to say to them.\"","cn":"","src":"2013·浙江·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读D","year":2013,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"I <B>simply</B> adore his music!","cn":"我简直太喜爱他的音乐了！","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"simple","ph":"/ˈsimpl/","cn":"adj. 简单的；单纯的；天真的；n. 笨蛋；愚蠢的行为"},{"w":"simplicity","ph":"/simˈplisiti/","cn":"n. 简单"},{"w":"simplify","ph":"/ˈsimplifai/","cn":"v. 简化；使单纯；使简易"},{"w":"simplified","ph":"/ˈsɪmplɪfaɪd/","cn":"adj. 简化了的，简化的；v. 简化，精简（s"},{"w":"simplification","ph":"/ˌsɪmplɪfɪˈkeɪʃn/","cn":"n. 简化，简单化，单纯化；简化的事物，简化形式"},{"w":"simpleness","ph":"","cn":"n. 简单；单纯"}],"syn":["merely","just","only","but"]},"tag":["gk"],"collins":4,"oxford":1,"frq":583,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/simply.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["sim","ply"]},"flags":[]},
