"starvation":{"w":"starvation","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"n. 饿死；挨饿；绝食","senses":[{"pos":"n","cn":["饿死","挨饿","绝食"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/stɑːˈveiʃən/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/stɑːrˈveɪʃ(ə)n/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=starvation&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"In fact, according to an official report on youth violence, \"In our country today, the greatest threat to the lives of children and adolescents is not disease or <B>starvation</B> or abandonment, but the terrible reality of violence\".","cn":"","src":"2012·浙江·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2012年高考英语（浙江）· 阅读C","year":2012,"region":"浙江","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"I was suffering from acute sunstroke, <B>starvation</B> and exhaustion.","cn":"我当时正受着急性中暑、饥饿和疲惫之苦。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Millions will face <B>starvation</B> next year as a result of the drought.","cn":"由于发生旱灾，明年将有数百万人面临饥饿的威胁。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"1.5 million people are in immediate danger of death from <B>starvation</B>.","cn":"150万人正因饥饿而即将面临死亡的危险。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"starve","ph":"/stɑːv/","cn":"v. 饿死；挨饿；渴望"},{"w":"starving","ph":"/ˈstɑːrvɪŋ/","cn":"adj. 饥饿的，挨饿的（字面义，因缺乏食物而受"},{"w":"starveling","ph":"/ˈstɑːrvlɪŋ/","cn":"n. 挨饿的人（或动物），饿瘦的人（或动物）；a"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","toefl"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":9590,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/starvation.webp","syl":{"n":3,"s":1,"l":["star","va","tion"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex"]},
