"subjective":{"w":"subjective","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 主观的；个人的；自觉的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["主观的","个人的","自觉的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/səbˈdʒektiv/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/səbˈdʒektɪv/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=subjective&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Everyone's opinion is bound to be <B>subjective</B>.","cn":"每个人的意见都必定是主观的。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"We know that taste in art is a <B>subjective</B> matter.","cn":"我们知道艺术品味是个主观问题。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"The answers are <B>subjective</B>.","cn":"这些答案是很主观的。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"In other words, we are treating people as if they weren't <B>subjective</B>, but instead were machines.","cn":"","src":"FORBES","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · FORBES"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"subject","ph":"/ˈsʌbdʒekt/","cn":"n. 主题；科目；[语] 主语；国民；adj. 服从的；"},{"w":"subjectivist","ph":"/səbˈdʒektɪvɪst/","cn":"n. 主观主义者；adj. 主观主义的"},{"w":"subjectively","ph":"/səbˈdʒektɪvli/","cn":"adv. 主观地，在主观上；臆想地；内省地"},{"w":"subjectivity","ph":"/ˌsʌbdʒekˈtɪvəti/","cn":"n. 主观性，主观；（哲学、文学理论）主体性"},{"w":"subjection","ph":"/səbˈdʒekʃ(ə)n/","cn":"n. 受支配，隶属，服从；征服，制伏"},{"w":"subjectivism","ph":"/səbˈdʒektɪvɪzəm/","cn":"n. 主观主义；主观性"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet6","ky","ielts","gre"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":5947,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/subjective.webp","syl":{"n":3,"s":1,"l":["sub","jec","tive"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
