"unbearable":{"w":"unbearable","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 难以忍受的；承受不住的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["难以忍受的","承受不住的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/.ʌnˈbєərəbl/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ʌnˈberəb(ə)l/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=unbearable&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"I'd thought I could hold out till my dentist came back from holiday, but the pain was really <B>unbearable</B>.","cn":"","src":"2013·重庆·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（重庆）· 阅读A","year":2013,"region":"重庆","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"If you don't enjoy what you do, it is going to feel like <B>unbearable</B> pain and will likely make you quit well before you ever become good at it.","cn":"","src":"2013·广东·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（广东）· 阅读B","year":2013,"region":"广东","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"They say that the quality of life is as important as life itself, and that people should not be forced to go on living when conditions of life have become <B>unbearable</B> .","cn":"","src":"九年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"The heat was becoming <B>unbearable</B>.","cn":"炎热开始变得难以忍受。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"unbearably","ph":"/ʌnˈberəbli/","cn":"adv. 不堪忍受地，无法容忍地"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","toefl"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":10284,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/45c6b537d2f2b99c34cc0cd2d8a4117d.jpg?","syl":{"n":4,"s":1,"l":["un","bea","ra","ble"]},"flags":["fam_gap"]},
"uncertain":{"w":"uncertain","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 无常的；含糊的；靠不住的；迟疑不决的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["无常的","含糊的","靠不住的","迟疑不决的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/.ʌnˈsəːtn/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ʌnˈsɜːrt(ə)n/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=uncertain&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"However, it remains <B>uncertain</B> whether differences in measurement techniques or chance variations are responsible for this disparity.","cn":"","src":"2023·上海（秋考）·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2023年高考英语（上海（秋考））· 阅读C","year":2023,"region":"上海（秋考）","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"The thing is, regular exercise to get \"in shape\" requires constant and considerable effort — all for gradual progress and <B>uncertain</B> rewards.","cn":"","src":"2024·天津第一次·阅读Passage 1","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2024年高考英语（天津第一次）· 阅读Passage 1","year":2024,"region":"天津第一次","section":"阅读Passage 1"},{"en":"According to him, the weather in England is very changeable and <B>uncertain</B> and it attracts the English as well as the outsider.","cn":"","src":"2013·重庆·阅读E","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（重庆）· 阅读E","year":2013,"region":"重庆","section":"阅读E"},{"en":"She hesitated, <B>uncertain</B> how to classify herself.","cn":"她犹豫了，不知如何定义自己。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"uncertainly","ph":"/ʌnˈsɜːrtnli/","cn":"adv. 不确定地，没把握地，犹豫地；（尤指移动"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6"],"collins":2,"oxford":1,"frq":4291,"img":"https://ydlunacommon-cdn.nosdn.127.net/cd4f0d8dbc2e4c22fd706d29969622b2.jpg?","syl":{"n":3,"s":1,"l":["un","cer","tain"]},"flags":["fam_gap"]},
"unconditional":{"w":"unconditional","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 无条件的；绝对的；无限制的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["无条件的","绝对的","无限制的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/.ʌnkənˈdiʃənl/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˌʌnkənˈdɪʃən(ə)l/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=unconditional&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"They demanded (an) <B>unconditional</B> surrender.","cn":"他们要求无条件投降。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"My love for all my children is <B>unconditional</B>.","cn":"我对我所有孩子的疼爱是无条件的。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Children need <B>unconditional</B> love from their parents.","cn":"孩子们需要父母无条件的爱。","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Nothing is for sale at Figment: one of the tenets of the festival is <B>unconditional</B> gifting.","cn":"","src":"BBC","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · BBC"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"unconditioned","ph":"/ˌʌnkənˈdɪʃnd/","cn":"adj. [数] 无条件的；绝对的"},{"w":"unconditionally","ph":"/ˌʌnkənˈdɪʃənəli/","cn":"adv. 无条件地，毫无保留地"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","ielts"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":11570,"img":"","syl":{"n":5,"s":2,"l":["un","con","di","tion","al"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","no_img"]},
"unconscious":{"w":"unconscious","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 无意识的；失去知觉的；不省人事的；未发觉的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["无意识的","失去知觉的","不省人事的","未发觉的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/.ʌnˈkɒnʃəs/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ʌnˈkɑːnʃəs/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=unconscious&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Her mind wants to turn conscious, newly learned skills into <B>unconscious</B>, automatically performed skills.","cn":"","src":"2009·上海（秋考）·阅读D","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2009年高考英语（上海（秋考））· 阅读D","year":2009,"region":"上海（秋考）","section":"阅读D"},{"en":"In the illogical <B>unconscious</B>, we may feel as if it is precisely because the other person has the trait or thing we want that we cannot have it.","cn":"","src":"2020·上海春考·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2020年高考英语（上海春考）· 阅读A","year":2020,"region":"上海春考","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"The young man flopped back, <B>unconscious</B>.","cn":"那年轻人仰面倒下，不省人事。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"He had drunk himself <B>unconscious</B> on vodka.","cn":"他喝伏特加酒喝得不省人事。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"unconsciously","ph":"/ʌnˈkɑːnʃəsli/","cn":"adv. 无意识地，无意中，不知不觉"},{"w":"unconsciousness","ph":"/ʌnˈkɑːnʃəsnəs/","cn":"n. 无意识，意识不清，人事不省"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","toefl","ielts","gre"],"collins":2,"oxford":1,"frq":5668,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/unconscious.webp","syl":{"n":3,"s":1,"l":["un","con","scious"]},"flags":[]},
