"undivided":{"w":"undivided","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 专心的；专一的；未分开的；完整的；v. 未分开（undivide的过去式和过去分词）","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["专心的","专一的","未分开的","完整的"]},{"pos":"v","cn":["未分开（undivide的过去式和过去分词）"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/.ʌndiˈvaidid/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˌʌndɪˈvaɪdɪd/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=undivided&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Mandela said, \"We want a united, <B>undivided</B> South Africa.\"","cn":"曼德拉说：“我们要一个统一的、未被分裂的南非。”","src":"柯林斯","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《柯林斯英汉双解大词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"His greatest need is for his parents' <B>undivided</B> attention.","cn":"他最大的需求是他父母对他一心一意的关注。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Since we're on the road a lot, I have 20 minutes or more of their <B>undivided</B> attention and we chat about bigger topics.","cn":"由于我们经常在路上，我能获得他们二十分钟以上的全神贯注的时间，和他们聊一些更有深度的话题。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"First, he got a deed to an <B>undivided</B> one-half interest in real estate in Cochise County.","cn":"","src":"CENTERFORSECURITYP","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · CENTERFORSECURITYP"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk"],"collins":0,"oxford":0,"frq":20480,"img":"","syl":{"n":4,"s":2,"l":["un","di","vi","ded"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","no_img","fam_gap"]},
