"unfortunate":{"w":"unfortunate","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 不幸的；令人遗憾的；不成功的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["不幸的","令人遗憾的","不成功的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/.ʌnˈfɒːtʃənit/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ʌnˈfɔːrtʃənət/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=unfortunate&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"It was an <B>unfortunate</B> accident.","cn":"那是一次不幸的事故。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"She described the decision as '<B>unfortunate</B>'.","cn":"她把这项决定说成是“令人遗憾”。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"He was <B>unfortunate</B> to lose in the final round.","cn":"他不幸在最后一轮输了。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"},{"en":"Botha has taken just four wickets in his two Test appearances, but Nel may feel more <B>unfortunate</B>.","cn":"","src":"BBC","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · BBC"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"unfortunately","ph":"/ʌnˈfɔːtjjnətli/","cn":"adv. 不幸地"}],"syn":[]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6"],"collins":2,"oxford":1,"frq":4970,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/unfortunate.webp","syl":{"n":4,"s":1,"l":["un","for","tu","nate"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex","fam_gap"]},
"unfortunately":{"w":"unfortunately","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adv. 不幸地","senses":[{"pos":"adv","cn":["不幸地"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ʌnˈfɔːtjjnətli/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ʌnˈfɔːrtʃənətli/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=unfortunately&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"<B>Unfortunately</B>, also like her mother, she developed leukemia because of her work with radioactivity.","cn":"","src":"2011·陕西·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2011年高考英语（陕西）· 阅读A","year":2011,"region":"陕西","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"But <B>unfortunately</B>, the parents are wronged because they're normal in shape, or rather slim.","cn":"","src":"2013·湖北·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2013年高考英语（湖北）· 阅读C","year":2013,"region":"湖北","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"<B>Unfortunately</B>, most of these images are more negative than they should be.","cn":"","src":"2008·广东·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2008年高考英语（广东）· 阅读B","year":2008,"region":"广东","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"I like cats but <B>unfortunately</B> I'm allergic to them.","cn":"我喜欢猫，但遗憾的是我对猫过敏。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"unfortunate","ph":"/.ʌnˈfɒːtʃənit/","cn":"adj. 不幸的；令人遗憾的；不成功的"}],"syn":["alas"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky","toefl"],"collins":3,"oxford":1,"frq":2016,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/unfortunately.webp","syl":{"n":5,"s":1,"l":["un","for","tu","na","tely"]},"flags":[]},
