"wag":{"w":"wag","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"v. 摇摆；摇动；饶舌；n. 摇摆；爱说笑打趣的人","senses":[{"pos":"v","cn":["摇摆","摇动","饶舌"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["摇摆","爱说笑打趣的人"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/wæg/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/wæɡ/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=wag&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Dogs <B>wag</B> their tails when they are pleased.","cn":"狗一高兴就摇尾巴。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Dogs, for example, will <B>wag</B> their tails, get down their front legs, and stick their behinds in the air to indicate \"what follows is just for play\".","cn":"例如，狗会摇尾巴，放下前腿，把屁股翘在空中，表示“以下的动作只是为了好玩”。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Beddgelert, however, was barely alive. Nonetheless, he found the strength to <B>wag</B> his tail and to raise his head from the bed to greet his master.","cn":"而贝德格勒特却已经奄奄一息，但他还是使劲摇了摇尾巴，抬起头来迎接自己的主人。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Walgreens ( <B>WAG</B>) releases its earnings on September 28, and has a current yield of 3.1%.","cn":"","src":"FORBES","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · FORBES"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[],"syn":["wit","card"]},"tag":["gk","cet6","toefl","gre"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":11879,"img":"https://ydlunacommon.nosdn.127.net/0b0edaa6f43baa38d374cc2d4b98c803.png?","syl":{"n":1,"s":0,"l":["wag"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
