"wealthy":{"w":"wealthy","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 富有的；充分的；丰裕的；n. 富人","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["富有的","充分的","丰裕的"]},{"pos":"n","cn":["富人"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈwelθi/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈwelθi/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=wealthy&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"However <B>wealthy</B> we may be, we can never find enough hours in the day to do everything we want.","cn":"","src":"2014·江苏·阅读B","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（江苏）· 阅读B","year":2014,"region":"江苏","section":"阅读B"},{"en":"At the age of six months she was acquired, along with her sister, by John Ashley, a <B>wealthy</B> Massachusetts slaveholders.","cn":"","src":"2014·山东·阅读C","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2014年高考英语（山东）· 阅读C","year":2014,"region":"山东","section":"阅读C"},{"en":"Some people believe that a Robin Hood is at work, others that a <B>wealthy</B> person simply wants to distribute his or her fortune before dying.","cn":"","src":"2012·福建·阅读A","srcType":"gaokao","srcFull":"2012年高考英语（福建）· 阅读A","year":2012,"region":"福建","section":"阅读A"},{"en":"They live in a <B>wealthy</B> suburb of Chicago.","cn":"他们住在芝加哥郊区的一处富人区。","src":"牛津","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"《牛津词典》（有道词典接口）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"wealth","ph":"/welθ/","cn":"n. 财富；大量；富有"},{"w":"wealthily","ph":"/ˈwelθɪli/","cn":"adv. 丰富地；富有地"}],"syn":["flush","substantial"]},"tag":["gk","cet4","cet6","ky"],"collins":2,"oxford":0,"frq":3015,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/wealthy.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["weal","thy"]},"flags":[]},
