"outwards":{"w":"outwards","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adv. 向外，在外；adj. 向外的， 外出的","senses":[{"pos":"adv","cn":["向外","在外"]},{"pos":"adj","cn":["向外的","外出的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈautwədz/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈaʊtwərdz/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=outwards&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"Now pull the corners <B>outwards</B> and downwards.","cn":"现在向下向外拉开这个角。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"The simplest way to extract this statement is to start from the innermost parentheses and build <B>outwards</B>.","cn":"提取这个语句的最简单的方式是从最内层的圆括号开始向外构建。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"I am seeking a true partnership of mind and body, where we live in harmony with one another, looking <B>outwards</B> in the same direction, enjoying life to the full.","cn":"我正在寻求身心上真正的伙伴关系，在这里我们彼此和睦相处，朝着同一方向向外看，充分享受生活。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"But the earth itself radiating energy <B>outwards</B> in the form of long-wave heat rays.","cn":"","src":"FORBES","srcType":"news","srcFull":"新闻语料 · FORBES"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"out","ph":"/aut/","cn":"adv. 出现；在外；出局；出声地；不流行地；adj. "},{"w":"outer","ph":"/ˈautə/","cn":"adj. 外面的，外部的；远离中心的；n. 环外命中"},{"w":"outermost","ph":"/ˈautəməust/","cn":"adj. 最外面的，最远的"},{"w":"outing","ph":"/ˈautiŋ/","cn":"n. 远足；短途旅游；体育比赛；adj. 远足适用的；v"},{"w":"outward","ph":"/ˈautwəd/","cn":"adj. 向外的；外面的；公开的；外服的；肉体的；adv"},{"w":"outmost","ph":"/ˈaʊtˌmoʊst/","cn":"adj. 最外面的，最远的"}],"syn":["outward"]},"tag":["cet4","cet6"],"collins":1,"oxford":0,"frq":29133,"img":"https://0xlei.tech/words/atlas/img/outwards.webp","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["ou","twards"]},"flags":["no_exam_ex"]},
