"woolen":{"w":"woolen","firstLevel":"高中","cn":"adj. 羊毛的， 羊毛制的","senses":[{"pos":"adj","cn":["羊毛的","羊毛制的"]}],"ph":{"uk":"/ˈwulin/","ukSrc":"ECDICT","us":"/ˈwʊlən/","usSrc":"有道"},"audio":{"url":"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=woolen&type=2","src":"有道真人发音"},"ex":[{"en":"I even keep my old <B>woolen</B> clothes and cotton T-shirts, and use them for cleaning.","cn":"","src":"九年级·阅读理解","srcType":"zhongkao","srcFull":"中考真题 · 阅读理解（该来源未提供年份/地区）","year":0,"section":"阅读理解"},{"en":"The cold-bed batch type steam dyeing process for <B>woolen</B> yarn by reactive dyes is described in this book.","cn":"本书介绍了羊毛纱线活性染料的冷床间歇式蒸染色方法。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Wearing a Canada team sweatshirt, a <B>woolen</B> cap and sunglasses, she picked up the gold medal, snapped a photograph and turned over the prize to see the back.","cn":"她穿着加拿大队的运动衫，戴着羊毛帽和太阳镜，拿起金牌，拍了张照片，把奖品翻过来看背面。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"},{"en":"Based on records from ancient Athens, each year young Athenian women collaborated to weave a new <B>woolen</B> robe that they used to dress a statue of the goddess Athena.","cn":"根据古代雅典的记载，每年雅典的年轻妇女都要合作织成一件新的羊毛长袍，用来装饰雅典娜女神的雕像。","src":"有道例句","srcType":"dict","srcFull":"有道词典双语例句（接口未标注具体词典）"}],"fam":{"root":"","affix":[],"derive":[{"w":"wool","ph":"/wul/","cn":"n. 羊毛；毛线，绒线"},{"w":"woolly","ph":"/ˈwʊli/","cn":"adj. 羊毛的，羊毛制的；似羊毛的，毛茸茸的；"},{"w":"wooly","ph":"/ˈwʊli/","cn":"adj. （woolly 的变体拼写）羊毛的，羊"},{"w":"woolsorter","ph":"/ˈwʊlˌsɔːrtər/","cn":"n. 羊毛工（把羊毛分类的人）"},{"w":"woollen","ph":"/ˈwulin/","cn":"adj. 羊毛制的；n. 毛织品"}],"syn":["wool"]},"tag":["toefl"],"collins":0,"oxford":0,"frq":16629,"img":"","syl":{"n":2,"s":0,"l":["woo","len"]},"flags":["few_exam_ex","no_img"]},
